{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0129ArZe9q4WrrHWwJQ9EJgG","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 降级为 \"tends to help\"：embedding mining 方向正确但 effect size\n2\t  缩水约 50%， 多 seed CI 宽（2–4pp），个别 seed delta < 0.5pp。BM25 baseline 方向一致（harm）但 delta\n3\t  小且 p > 0.05，CoCoHaNeRe correction 论证从 \"empirically verified\" 改为 \"BM25 proxy 方向一致但\n4\t  effect size 不足以排除混杂\"。Claim 2 降级为 exploratory observation：dataflow 在 Qwen 上 CI 包含\n5\t  0，StarCoder 上方向为负，合并进 Claim 1 作为 strategy-encoder interaction case。SWE-bench delta\n6\t  < 1pp 且 CI 包含 0， 无法作为独立 evidence。论文重心移向 systematic empirical comparison + representation\n7\t  geometry analysis。标题用 \"Systematic Study\"，定位 analysis paper。\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: SWE-bench Lite End-to-End Evaluation\n12\t  plan_id: plan_003\n13\t  description: 3 strategies × best checkpoint (Qwen), Qwen3.6-27B agent, 300 SWE-bench\n14\t    Lite instances\n15\t  expected_results:\n16\t    random_resolve_rate_pct: 23.0\n17\t    random_resolved_count: 69\n18\t    embedding_resolve_rate_pct: 23.7\n19\t    embedding_resolved_count: 71\n20\t    dataflow_resolve_rate_pct: 23.3\n21\t    dataflow_resolved_count: 70\n22\t    emb_minus_random_delta_pp: 0.7\n23\t    df_minus_random_delta_pp: 0.3\n24\t    total_instances: 300\n25\t    retrieval_R1_on_swebench_random: 0.41\n26\t    retrieval_R1_on_swebench_embedding: 0.42\n27\t    retrieval_R1_on_swebench_dataflow: 0.41\n28\t  result_rationale: 'SWE-bench Lite 的 resolve rate 由 agent 生成能力主导，retrieval 只是 pipeline\n29\t    的第一步。median 档下 retrieval R@1 delta 仅 ~1pp，传导到 end-to-end 后进一步 衰减：即使 retrieval\n30\t    多找对 1-2 个 file，agent 是否能利用这个 file 生成正确 patch 是独立的噪声源。300 instances 上 2 个 count\n31\t    的差异对应 ~0.7pp，远不够 statistical significance。此外 SWE-bench 的 repo 分布与 SWE-smith training\n32\t    分布有 domain shift， 进一步压缩了 retrieval improvement 的传导效率。\n33\t\n34\t    '\n35\t  tables:\n36\t  - name: 'Table: SWE-bench Lite Resolve Rate by Strategy'\n37\t    columns:\n38\t    - Strategy\n39\t    - Resolved\n40\t    - Total\n41\t    - Rate (%)\n42\t    - Δ vs Random (pp)\n43\t    rows:\n44\t    - - random\n45\t      - 69\n46\t      - 300\n47\t      - 23.0\n48\t      - —\n49\t    - - embedding\n50\t      - 71\n51\t      - 300\n52\t      - 23.7\n53\t      - '+0.7'\n54\t    - - dataflow\n55\t      - 70\n56\t      - 300\n57\t      - 23.3\n58\t      - '+0.3'\n59\t  - name: 'Table: Retrieval-Stage R@1 on SWE-bench Repos'\n60\t    columns:\n61\t    - Strategy\n62\t    - R@1\n63\t    - R@5\n64\t    rows:\n65\t    - - random\n66\t      - 0.41\n67\t      - 0.78\n68\t    - - embedding\n69\t      - 0.42\n70\t      - 0.79\n71\t    - - dataflow\n72\t      - 0.41\n73\t      - 0.78\n74\t  figures_description:\n75\t  - 'Bar chart: resolve rate by strategy with 95% bootstrap CI error bars. All three\n76\t    bars overlap heavily, CI bands span ~4pp each.'\n77\t  - 'Scatter plot: per-instance retrieval correctness vs resolve outcome, colored\n78\t    by strategy. Shows that retrieval success is necessary but not sufficient — many\n79\t    correctly-retrieved instances still fail at generation.'\n80\t  analysis: 'SWE-bench delta 不足以支撑独立 claim。resolve rate 差异 < 1pp，在 N=300 上无统计 显著性（见\n81\t    plan_016）。Retrieval-stage R@1 差异同样微小（~1pp），说明 SWE-smith 到 SWE-bench 的 domain gap\n82\t    进一步压平了 strategy 差异。论文中应作为 \"sanity check\" 而非 primary evidence 呈现：确认 negative mining\n83\t    策略不 harm downstream performance， 但不能 claim 显著 improvement。需在 limitation 中讨论 300\n84\t    instances 的 power 不足问题。\n85\t\n86\t    '\n87\t- name: RepoBench-R Cross-File Retrieval Evaluation\n88\t  plan_id: plan_004\n89\t  description: 3 strategies × 3 seeds × 2 encoders, RepoBench-R test_easy (8K, pool~6)\n90\t    + test_hard (8K, pool~18), with 95% CIs\n91\t  expected_results:\n92\t    qwen_test_easy:\n93\t      random_R1_mean: 0.682\n94\t      embedding_R1_mean: 0.688\n95\t      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.685\n96\t      emb_minus_random_pp: 0.6\n97\t      emb_minus_random_CI:\n98\t      - -0.2\n99\t      - 1.4\n100\t    qwen_test_hard:\n101\t      random_R1_mean: 0.394\n102\t      embedding_R1_mean: 0.404\n103\t      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.398\n104\t      emb_minus_random_pp: 1.0\n105\t      emb_minus_random_CI:\n106\t      - -0.1\n107\t      - 2.1\n108\t    starcoder_test_easy:\n109\t      random_R1_mean: 0.621\n110\t      embedding_R1_mean: 0.626\n111\t      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.618\n112\t      emb_minus_random_pp: 0.5\n113\t      emb_minus_random_CI:\n114\t      - -0.3\n115\t      - 1.3\n116\t    starcoder_test_hard:\n117\t      random_R1_mean: 0.338\n118\t      embedding_R1_mean: 0.346\n119\t      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.333\n120\t      emb_minus_random_pp: 0.8\n121\t      emb_minus_random_CI:\n122\t      - -0.4\n123\t      - 2.0\n124\t    overall_delta_pp_range:\n125\t    - 0.0\n126\t    - 1.5\n127\t  result_rationale: 'RepoBench-R 的 test_easy pool 仅 ~6 candidates，所有策略接近 ceiling，strategy\n128\t    差异被压缩到 < 1pp。test_hard pool ~18 提供更多区分空间，delta 稍大（~1pp）但仍在 CI 包含 0 的边缘。RepoBench-R\n129\t    与 SWE-smith 的 task 定义不同（cross-file completion vs bug-fix retrieval），domain shift\n130\t    进一步削弱了 training-time strategy 差异的 传导。8K instances 的大样本量使 per-strategy CI 较窄（~1.5pp\n131\t    width），但 delta 的 CI 仍 ~2pp width，因为 strategy 间的 paired variance 较大。Dataflow 在\n132\t    StarCoder 上一致为负（-0.5pp），符合 pilot 发现的 encoder-strategy interaction pattern。\n133\t\n134\t    '\n135\t  tables:\n136\t  - name: 'Table: RepoBench-R R@1 by Strategy × Encoder × Difficulty'\n137\t    columns:\n138\t    - Encoder\n139\t    - Split\n140\t    - Random\n141\t    - Embedding\n142\t    - Dataflow\n143\t    - Emb Δ (pp)\n144\t    - DF Δ (pp)\n145\t    rows:\n146\t    - - Qwen\n147\t      - easy\n148\t      - 68.2 ± 0.7\n149\t      - 68.8 ± 0.8\n150\t      - 68.5 ± 0.9\n151\t      - '+0.6'\n152\t      - '+0.3'\n153\t    - - Qwen\n154\t      - hard\n155\t      - 39.4 ± 1.0\n156\t      - 40.4 ± 1.1\n157\t      - 39.8 ± 1.2\n158\t      - '+1.0'\n159\t      - '+0.4'\n160\t    - - StarCoder\n161\t      - easy\n162\t      - 62.1 ± 0.6\n163\t      - 62.6 ± 0.7\n164\t      - 61.8 ± 0.8\n165\t      - '+0.5'\n166\t      - −0.3\n167\t    - - StarCoder\n168\t      - hard\n169\t      - 33.8 ± 0.9\n170\t      - 34.6 ± 1.0\n171\t      - 33.3 ± 1.1\n172\t      - '+0.8'\n173\t      - −0.5\n174\t  figures_description:\n175\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: R@1 by strategy for each (encoder × split) combination, with\n176\t    95% seed-level CI error bars. Easy splits visually flat, hard splits show small\n177\t    embedding advantage with overlapping CIs.'\n178\t  - 'Delta plot (forest plot style): embedding-random and dataflow-random deltas with\n179\t    CIs for each (encoder × split). Most CIs cross zero; Qwen hard is the only condition\n180\t    where the lower bound approaches 0.'\n181\t  analysis: 'RepoBench-R 提供了 second benchmark 覆盖，方向一致（embedding ≥ random > dataflow\n182\t    on StarCoder），但 effect size 不足以独立支撑 claim。test_hard 上的 delta 稍大， 说明 pool size\n183\t    对 strategy 效果有调节作用（与 plan_019 呼应）。论文中报告为 \"directional consistency across benchmarks\"\n184\t    而非 \"significant improvement on second benchmark\"。CIs 需在 Table 中完整展示以示 transparency。\n185\t\n186\t    '\n187\t- name: Stratified Retrieval Analysis (5 Strata)\n188\t  plan_id: plan_005\n189\t  description: 分层分析：repo size / pool size / query-pos similarity / structural data\n190\t    availability / neg_difficulty quartile\n191\t  expected_results:\n192\t    stratum_1_repo_size:\n193\t      small_lt50_emb_delta_pp: 1.8\n194\t      medium_50_200_emb_delta_pp: 1.2\n195\t      large_200_500_emb_delta_pp: 0.6\n196\t      xlarge_500plus_emb_delta_pp: 0.4\n197\t    stratum_2_pool_size:\n198\t      pool_lt10_emb_delta_pp: 0.3\n199\t      pool_10_50_emb_delta_pp: 1.1\n200\t      pool_50plus_emb_delta_pp: 0.7\n201\t    stratum_3_query_pos_sim:\n202\t      high_sim_gt098_emb_delta_pp: 0.5\n203\t      medium_sim_090_098_emb_delta_pp: 1.3\n204\t      low_sim_lt090_emb_delta_pp: 1.0\n205\t    stratum_4_structural_availability:\n206\t      with_dataflow_34pct:\n207\t        random_R1: 0.538\n208\t        embedding_R1: 0.548\n209\t        dataflow_R1: 0.544\n210\t        df_minus_random_pp: 0.6\n211\t        emb_minus_random_pp: 1.0\n212\t      fallback_66pct:\n213\t        random_R1: 0.526\n214\t        embedding_R1: 0.536\n215\t        dataflow_R1: 0.527\n216\t        df_minus_random_pp: 0.1\n217\t        emb_minus_random_pp: 1.0\n218\t    stratum_5_neg_difficulty_quartile:\n219\t      Q1_easiest:\n220\t        emb_delta_pp: 0.3\n221\t        df_delta_pp: -0.2\n222\t      Q2:\n223\t        emb_delta_pp: 0.8\n224\t        df_delta_pp: 0.1\n225\t      Q3:\n226\t        emb_delta_pp: 1.4\n227\t        df_delta_pp: 0.5\n228\t      Q4_hardest:\n229\t        emb_delta_pp: 1.6\n230\t        df_delta_pp: 1.2\n231\t  result_rationale: 'Repo size 分层：小 repo 的 pool 小、diversity 低，embedding mining 更容易找到有意义\n232\t    的 hard negatives，所以 delta 最大。大 repo 中 pool 大但 noise 也大（更多 unrelated files），embedding\n233\t    mining 优势被稀释。Pool size 分层与 repo size 部分共线但不完全： pool < 10 时 all strategies 接近 ceiling\n234\t    所以 delta 小；pool 10-50 是 sweet spot； pool 50+ 时 noise 增加。Query-pos similarity 分层：high\n235\t    sim (> 0.98，Qwen 主导) 表明 representation 已饱和，embedding negatives 不够 hard，delta 小；medium\n236\t    sim 区间 embedding mining 最 effective。Structural availability 分层：34% 有 dataflow\n237\t    数据的 instances 上 dataflow strategy 有 +0.6pp 优势（真正用到了 structural signal）， 但 66%\n238\t    fallback instances 上 dataflow ≈ random（因为 fallback 到 random sampling）， 整体被 dilute。Neg\n239\t    difficulty quartile：Q4（最难 negatives）时 embedding 和 dataflow 都 help 最多，因为这些 cases\n240\t    正是模型最 confuse 的地方，harder negatives 提供最大 gradient signal。但 Q1-Q2 占比大，dilute 了整体\n241\t    effect。\n242\t\n243\t    '\n244\t  tables:\n245\t  - name: 'Table: Embedding Delta by Repo Size Stratum (Qwen)'\n246\t    columns:\n247\t    - Stratum\n248\t    - N instances\n249\t    - Random R@1\n250\t    - Emb R@1\n251\t    - Δ (pp)\n252\t    - 95% CI\n253\t    rows:\n254\t    - - small (<50)\n255\t      - 500\n256\t      - 0.571\n257\t      - 0.589\n258\t      - '+1.8'\n259\t      - '[-0.5, 4.1]'\n260\t    - - medium (50-200)\n261\t      - 4096\n262\t      - 0.542\n263\t      - 0.554\n264\t      - '+1.2'\n265\t      - '[0.0, 2.4]'\n266\t    - - large (200-500)\n267\t      - 13628\n268\t      - 0.531\n269\t      - 0.537\n270\t      - '+0.6'\n271\t      - '[-0.3, 1.5]'\n272\t    - - xlarge (500+)\n273\t      - 25949\n274\t      - 0.524\n275\t      - 0.528\n276\t      - '+0.4'\n277\t      - '[-0.5, 1.3]'\n278\t  - name: 'Table: Strategy Delta by Structural Data Availability (Qwen)'\n279\t    columns:\n280\t    - Stratum\n281\t    - N\n282\t    - Random R@1\n283\t    - Emb R@1\n284\t    - DF R@1\n285\t    - Emb Δ\n286\t    - DF Δ\n287\t    rows:\n288\t    - - with dataflow (34%)\n289\t      - ~15K\n290\t      - 0.538\n291\t      - 0.548\n292\t      - 0.544\n293\t      - '+1.0'\n294\t      - '+0.6'\n295\t    - - fallback (66%)\n296\t      - ~29K\n297\t      - 0.526\n298\t      - 0.536\n299\t      - 0.527\n300\t      - '+1.0'\n301\t      - '+0.1'\n302\t  - name: 'Table: Strategy Delta by Neg Difficulty Quartile (Qwen)'\n303\t    columns:\n304\t    - Quartile\n305\t    - Margin range\n306\t    - Emb Δ (pp)\n307\t    - DF Δ (pp)\n308\t    rows:\n309\t    - - Q1 (easiest)\n310\t      - '> 0.15'\n311\t      - '+0.3'\n312\t      - −0.2\n313\t    - - Q2\n314\t      - 0.08–0.15\n315\t      - '+0.8'\n316\t      - '+0.1'\n317\t    - - Q3\n318\t      - 0.02–0.08\n319\t      - '+1.4'\n320\t      - '+0.5'\n321\t    - - Q4 (hardest)\n322\t      - < 0.02\n323\t      - '+1.6'\n324\t      - '+1.2'\n325\t  figures_description:\n326\t  - 'Heatmap: strategy delta (pp) across (stratum × strategy) combinations. Color\n327\t    intensity encodes delta magnitude. Shows clear gradient for neg_difficulty quartile\n328\t    but noisy pattern for repo size.'\n329\t  - 'Line plot: embedding delta vs pool size (continuous), with LOESS smoothing. Shows\n330\t    inverted-U shape peaking at pool ~30-50, declining at pool > 100.'\n331\t  - 'Stacked bar: proportion of instances in each stratum, overlaid with per-stratum\n332\t    delta. Visualizes that the high-delta strata (small repo, Q4 difficulty) contain\n333\t    few instances, explaining why overall delta is modest.'\n334\t  analysis: '分层分析揭示了 effect size heterogeneity：embedding mining 在 small repo / high\n335\t    difficulty / medium similarity 条件下效果最好，但这些条件在实际分布中占比小。 Structural availability\n336\t    分层确认了 dataflow 的 conditional benefit 完全来自有 structural data 的 34%（delta +0.6pp），fallback\n337\t    的 66% 贡献为零。这解释了为什么 overall dataflow delta 被 dilute 到接近 0。Neg difficulty quartile\n338\t    分析提供了 最清晰的 mechanistic story：当 negatives 足够 hard（Q4），both strategies help； 当 negatives\n339\t    太 easy（Q1），neither helps much。这支持 representation geometry explanation 但 effect\n340\t    size 不足以作为独立 claim。\n341\t\n342\t    '\n343\t- name: Call-Graph Hop-Count Ablation\n344\t  plan_id: plan_007\n345\t  description: 1-hop vs 2-hop vs 3-hop call-graph bounding for dataflow negative selection\n346\t  expected_results:\n347\t    qwen_1hop_df_R1: 0.53\n348\t    qwen_2hop_df_R1: 0.532\n349\t    qwen_3hop_df_R1: 0.529\n350\t    starcoder_1hop_df_R1: 0.434\n351\t    starcoder_2hop_df_R1: 0.437\n352\t    starcoder_3hop_df_R1: 0.436\n353\t    qwen_2hop_minus_1hop_pp: 0.2\n354\t    qwen_2hop_minus_3hop_pp: 0.3\n355\t    eligible_negatives_per_query:\n356\t      hop_1: 3.2\n357\t      hop_2: 8.7\n358\t      hop_3: 14.1\n359\t    fallback_to_random_pct:\n360\t      hop_1: 42\n361\t      hop_2: 28\n362\t      hop_3: 18\n363\t  result_rationale: '1-hop 限制太严格：平均每 query 只有 3.2 个 eligible dataflow-disconnected\n364\t    negatives， 42% 的 queries 不得不 fallback 到 random，稀释了 structural signal。2-hop 是 precision-recall\n365\t    sweet spot：8.7 eligible negatives 足够采样，fallback 率降到 28%。 3-hop 进一步扩大 candidate\n366\t    pool 但引入 semantically distant files（3-hop 以外的 files 很可能本来就和 query 无关），负 signal\n367\t    质量下降，反而略差于 2-hop。但三者 差异均 < 0.5pp，在 noise range 内，不构成 strong ablation signal。这也反映了\n368\t    median 档下 dataflow strategy 本身 effect size 就小，hop-count 作为 second-order effect\n369\t    自然更小。\n370\t\n371\t    '\n372\t  tables:\n373\t  - name: 'Table: Dataflow R@1 by Hop Count'\n374\t    columns:\n375\t    - Encoder\n376\t    - 1-hop\n377\t    - 2-hop\n378\t    - 3-hop\n379\t    - Best\n380\t    rows:\n381\t    - - Qwen\n382\t      - 0.53\n383\t      - 0.532\n384\t      - 0.529\n385\t      - 2-hop\n386\t    - - StarCoder\n387\t      - 0.434\n388\t      - 0.437\n389\t      - 0.436\n390\t      - 2-hop\n391\t  - name: 'Table: Negative Pool Statistics by Hop Count'\n392\t    columns:\n393\t    - Hops\n394\t    - Mean eligible neg/query\n395\t    - Fallback-to-random %\n396\t    rows:\n397\t    - - 1\n398\t      - 3.2\n399\t      - 42%\n400\t    - - 2\n401\t      - 8.7\n402\t      - 28%\n403\t    - - 3\n404\t      - 14.1\n405\t      - 18%\n406\t  figures_description:\n407\t  - 'Line plot: R@1 vs hop count (1, 2, 3) for both encoders. Nearly flat lines with\n408\t    error bars overlapping, showing 2-hop is marginally best.'\n409\t  - 'Histogram: distribution of eligible negatives per query at each hop count. 1-hop\n410\t    heavily left-skewed (many zeros), 2-hop more balanced, 3-hop right-shifted.'\n411\t  analysis: '2-hop 作为默认设置是合理的，但 ablation signal 太弱（< 0.5pp）无法 claim hop count 是 critical\n412\t    design choice。放入 appendix 作为 hyperparameter justification 即可。 更重要的 takeaway 是\n413\t    1-hop 的 high fallback rate（42%），说明 inter-procedural dataflow 的 coverage 本身就有限——这与\n414\t    plan_005 structural availability 分层的 34% 数字一致。\n415\t\n416\t    '\n417\t- name: Training Data Size Scaling\n418\t  plan_id: plan_008\n419\t  description: 1K vs 3K vs 5K training instances × 3 strategies, Qwen encoder\n420\t  expected_results:\n421\t    qwen_1K:\n422\t      random_R1: 0.498\n423\t      embedding_R1: 0.501\n424\t      dataflow_R1: 0.495\n425\t      emb_delta_pp: 0.3\n426\t    qwen_3K:\n427\t      random_R1: 0.519\n428\t      embedding_R1: 0.528\n429\t      dataflow_R1: 0.521\n430\t      emb_delta_pp: 0.9\n431\t    qwen_5K:\n432\t      random_R1: 0.53\n433\t      embedding_R1: 0.54\n434\t      dataflow_R1: 0.532\n435\t      emb_delta_pp: 1.0\n436\t    scaling_slope_R1_per_1K: 0.008\n437\t  result_rationale: '1K instances 时所有策略都 underfit：training data 不足以让 contrastive loss\n438\t    充分 学习，absolute R@1 低（~0.50）。Embedding mining 在 1K 时优势最小（+0.3pp）， 因为 1K instances\n439\t    中 embedding-distance 的 top-k negatives 覆盖了 corpus 的较小 subset，mining quality 受限于\n440\t    candidate pool diversity。3K 到 5K 的 scaling 呈 sub-linear 增长（+1.1pp absolute from\n441\t    3K→5K vs +2.1pp from 1K→3K），说明 returns diminishing。Strategy delta 的 scaling 也\n442\t    sub-linear：embedding 优势在 3K 时已接近 5K 水平。这表明 effect size 的上限由 pretrained representation\n443\t    quality 决定，不会随 data 无限增大。\n444\t\n445\t    '\n446\t  tables:\n447\t  - name: 'Table: R@1 by Data Size × Strategy (Qwen)'\n448\t    columns:\n449\t    - Size\n450\t    - Random\n451\t    - Embedding\n452\t    - Dataflow\n453\t    - Emb Δ (pp)\n454\t    rows:\n455\t    - - 1K\n456\t      - 0.498\n457\t      - 0.501\n458\t      - 0.495\n459\t      - '+0.3'\n460\t    - - 3K\n461\t      - 0.519\n462\t      - 0.528\n463\t      - 0.521\n464\t      - '+0.9'\n465\t    - - 5K (full)\n466\t      - 0.53\n467\t      - 0.54\n468\t      - 0.532\n469\t      - '+1.0'\n470\t  figures_description:\n471\t  - 'Line plot: R@1 vs training size for each strategy. Three upward-sloping lines\n472\t    with diminishing returns. Embedding line consistently above random but gap narrows\n473\t    at 1K.'\n474\t  - 'Bar chart: embedding delta (pp) at each data size. Shows delta growing from 0.3\n475\t    to 1.0 as data increases, suggesting mining benefit requires sufficient data diversity.'\n476\t  analysis: 'Data scaling 是 positive signal：说明 embedding mining 的 benefit 不是 overfitting\n477\t    artifact（否则小数据时 delta 应更大）。但 sub-linear scaling 和 5K 时仍只有 +1.0pp 的 delta 说明 pretrained\n478\t    representation quality 是 bottleneck，更多 data 不会 dramatically 改变 strategy ranking。适合放入\n479\t    appendix，支撑 \"mining benefit is real but modest\" 的 narrative。\n480\t\n481\t    '\n482\t- name: Fusion Head Ablation\n483\t  plan_id: plan_009\n484\t  description: Embedding-only vs structural-features-only vs combined scoring head\n485\t  expected_results:\n486\t    qwen_embedding_only_R1: 0.539\n487\t    qwen_structural_only_R1: 0.412\n488\t    qwen_combined_R1: 0.541\n489\t    starcoder_embedding_only_R1: 0.449\n490\t    starcoder_structural_only_R1: 0.378\n491\t    starcoder_combined_R1: 0.451\n492\t    combined_minus_embedding_only_pp: 0.2\n493\t  result_rationale: 'Structural-features-only（仅用 dataflow connectivity、call-graph\n494\t    distance 等 discrete features）大幅落后，因为 binary/categorical structural features 的\n495\t    信息量远不及 dense embedding。Combined head 相比 embedding-only 仅 +0.2pp， 因为在 median 档下\n496\t    structural signal 本身就弱（plan_005 已示），fusion 无法 从弱 signal 中 extract 出更多 information。这说明\n497\t    structural information 的 value 主要体现在 negative selection（training time）而非 scoring（inference\n498\t    time）。\n499\t\n500\t    '\n501\t  tables:\n502\t  - name: 'Table: Fusion Head Ablation R@1'\n503\t    columns:\n504\t    - Encoder\n505\t    - Emb-only\n506\t    - Struct-only\n507\t    - Combined\n508\t    - Combined−Emb (pp)\n509\t    rows:\n510\t    - - Qwen\n511\t      - 0.539\n512\t      - 0.412\n513\t      - 0.541\n514\t      - '+0.2'\n515\t    - - StarCoder\n516\t      - 0.449\n517\t      - 0.378\n518\t      - 0.451\n519\t      - '+0.2'\n520\t  figures_description:\n521\t  - 'Bar chart: R@1 by head type × encoder. Structural-only bar dramatically lower,\n522\t    combined and embedding-only nearly identical.'\n523\t  analysis: '确认 StructFuse 的 value 在 training-time negative selection 而非 inference-time\n524\t    feature fusion。Combined head 的 marginal gain 可能不值得 inference-time 的 CodeQL dependency。论文中作为\n525\t    appendix ablation，支撑 \"negative selection is the key mechanism\" 的 argument。\n526\t\n527\t    '\n528\t- name: Dataflow-Distance Weighted vs Binary Negatives\n529\t  plan_id: plan_010\n530\t  description: Weighted sampling by dataflow distance vs binary connected/disconnected\n531\t  expected_results:\n532\t    qwen_binary_df_R1: 0.532\n533\t    qwen_weighted_df_R1: 0.535\n534\t    starcoder_binary_df_R1: 0.437\n535\t    starcoder_weighted_df_R1: 0.439\n536\t    weighted_minus_binary_pp: 0.3\n537\t    weighted_minus_binary_CI:\n538\t    - -0.8\n539\t    - 1.4\n540\t  result_rationale: 'Distance-weighted sampling 理论上应该更好：给距离更远（更 disconnected）的 negatives\n541\t    更高采样概率，提供更 clean 的 structural signal。但在 median 档下 dataflow strategy 本身 effect\n542\t    size 就小，在此基础上的 second-order refinement 自然更小（+0.3pp），CI 宽且包含 0。实际上 binary 和 weighted\n543\t    的差异主要来自 少数 outlier queries（dataflow distance 分布高度 skewed），大多数 queries 的 negatives\n544\t    在两种 scheme 下 overlap 很大。\n545\t\n546\t    '\n547\t  tables:\n548\t  - name: 'Table: Binary vs Weighted Dataflow Negatives'\n549\t    columns:\n550\t    - Encoder\n551\t    - Binary DF R@1\n552\t    - Weighted DF R@1\n553\t    - Δ (pp)\n554\t    rows:\n555\t    - - Qwen\n556\t      - 0.532\n557\t      - 0.535\n558\t      - '+0.3'\n559\t    - - StarCoder\n560\t      - 0.437\n561\t      - 0.439\n562\t      - '+0.2'\n563\t  figures_description:\n564\t  - 'Paired scatter: per-query R@1 difference (weighted − binary) vs dataflow distance\n565\t    range. Most queries cluster near 0 difference; outliers with high distance range\n566\t    show positive delta.'\n567\t  analysis: 'Effect 太小，不值得增加 pipeline complexity。Binary 作为默认 simple choice 是合理的。 放入\n568\t    appendix 一句话即可。\n569\t\n570\t    '\n571\t- name: SWE-bench Failure Analysis\n572\t  plan_id: plan_011\n573\t  description: 50 SweRank/BM25 failures, categorize by whether dataflow helps\n574\t  expected_results:\n575\t    total_failures_analyzed: 50\n576\t    category_structural_gap: 14\n577\t    category_lexical_gap: 18\n578\t    category_multi_file_dependency: 8\n579\t    category_other: 10\n580\t    df_helps_in_structural_gap_pct: 57\n581\t    df_helps_overall_pct: 28\n582\t    emb_helps_overall_pct: 36\n583\t  result_rationale: '50 个 failure cases 中，仅 14 个（28%）属于 structural gap（即 gold file\n584\t    与 query 有 dataflow 关系但无 lexical similarity）。在这 14 个中，dataflow strategy 成功 retrieve\n585\t    了 8 个（57%），但剩余 6 个仍然 fail 因为 structural data 不覆盖（34% coverage limitation）。最大的\n586\t    failure category 是 lexical gap（36%，query 描述 与 target file 用语完全不同），这两种 strategy\n587\t    都无法解决。这解释了为什么 overall effect size 小：真正 benefit from structural signal 的 cases\n588\t    只占 ~28%，且其中 仍有近半 coverage 不足。\n589\t\n590\t    '\n591\t  tables:\n592\t  - name: 'Table: Failure Category Distribution'\n593\t    columns:\n594\t    - Category\n595\t    - Count\n596\t    - '%'\n597\t    - DF helps\n598\t    - Emb helps\n599\t    rows:\n600\t    - - Structural gap\n601\t      - 14\n602\t      - 28%\n603\t      - 8 (57%)\n604\t      - 5 (36%)\n605\t    - - Lexical gap\n606\t      - 18\n607\t      - 36%\n608\t      - 3 (17%)\n609\t      - 6 (33%)\n610\t    - - Multi-file dependency\n611\t      - 8\n612\t      - 16%\n613\t      - 4 (50%)\n614\t      - 5 (63%)\n615\t    - - Other\n616\t      - 10\n617\t      - 20%\n618\t      - 1 (10%)\n619\t      - 2 (20%)\n620\t  figures_description:\n621\t  - 'Stacked horizontal bar: failure categories with sub-bars showing DF-helps vs\n622\t    DF-not-helps. Structural gap bar has the highest DF-helps proportion but is a\n623\t    minority category.'\n624\t  analysis: 'Failure analysis 提供了 qualitative evidence 支撑 \"structural signal helps\n625\t    in specific conditions\" 的 narrative，但也暴露了 ceiling：真正 structural gap 的 cases 只占\n626\t    28%，coverage 限制了其中一半。适合放入 Section 5 的 analysis 段落， 不足以 support independent claim。\n627\t\n628\t    '\n629\t- name: Qualitative Case Studies\n630\t  plan_id: plan_012\n631\t  description: 5-10 cases where structural negatives changed retrieval outcome\n632\t  expected_results:\n633\t    total_cases_selected: 7\n634\t    cases_df_uniquely_helps: 3\n635\t    cases_emb_uniquely_helps: 2\n636\t    cases_both_help: 2\n637\t    avg_gold_rank_improvement_df: 4.2\n638\t    avg_gold_rank_improvement_emb: 2.8\n639\t  result_rationale: 'Cherry-picking 7 个 illustrative cases。3 个 cases 中 dataflow strategy\n640\t    将 gold file 从 rank 8-15 提升到 rank 1-3（大幅改善），这些 cases 的共同特征是 gold file 与 query 有\n641\t    call-chain dependency 但无 keyword overlap。2 个 cases 中 embedding strategy 独特帮助（gold\n642\t    file 与 query 有 similar variable naming 但 random negatives 中缺少 near-miss distractors）。但\n643\t    cherry-picked cases 不代表 overall distribution（见 plan_011 的 28% structural gap rate）。\n644\t\n645\t    '\n646\t  tables:\n647\t  - name: 'Table: Selected Qualitative Cases'\n648\t    columns:\n649\t    - Case\n650\t    - Repo\n651\t    - Issue type\n652\t    - Random rank\n653\t    - Emb rank\n654\t    - DF rank\n655\t    - Key observation\n656\t    rows:\n657\t    - - 1\n658\t      - repo_A\n659\t      - missing import\n660\t      - 12\n661\t      - 8\n662\t      - 2\n663\t      - DF finds cross-module callee\n664\t    - - 2\n665\t      - repo_B\n666\t      - API mismatch\n667\t      - 9\n668\t      - 3\n669\t      - 4\n670\t      - Emb finds similar naming\n671\t    - - 3\n672\t      - repo_C\n673\t      - config propagation\n674\t      - 15\n675\t      - 11\n676\t      - 1\n677\t      - DF traces config flow\n678\t    - - 4\n679\t      - repo_D\n680\t      - type error\n681\t      - 6\n682\t      - 2\n683\t      - 3\n684\t      - Both find related types\n685\t    - - 5\n686\t      - repo_E\n687\t      - null pointer\n688\t      - 11\n689\t      - 7\n690\t      - 3\n691\t      - DF finds data source\n692\t    - - 6\n693\t      - repo_F\n694\t      - method override\n695\t      - 4\n696\t      - 1\n697\t      - 5\n698\t      - Emb captures signature sim\n699\t    - - 7\n700\t      - repo_G\n701\t      - circular dep\n702\t      - 14\n703\t      - 10\n704\t      - 2\n705\t      - DF traces dependency cycle\n706\t  figures_description:\n707\t  - Side-by-side code snippets for top 3 DF-helps cases, showing query → gold file\n708\t    with dataflow path highlighted. Annotated with rank under each strategy.\n709\t  analysis: 'Qualitative examples 是论文的 illustration 而非 evidence。选择具有 pedagogical value\n710\t    的 cases 来解释 mechanism。在 median 档下，需要 caveat \"these are selected to illustrate\n711\t    the mechanism; overall effect size is modest (Table X)\"。\n712\t\n713\t    '\n714\t- name: Temperature Ablation\n715\t  plan_id: plan_014\n716\t  description: τ ∈ {0.05, 0.1, 0.2} × 3 strategies × 2 encoders\n717\t  expected_results:\n718\t    qwen:\n719\t      tau_005:\n720\t        random_R1: 0.53\n721\t        embedding_R1: 0.54\n722\t        dataflow_R1: 0.532\n723\t        emb_delta_pp: 1.0\n724\t      tau_010:\n725\t        random_R1: 0.537\n726\t        embedding_R1: 0.545\n727\t        dataflow_R1: 0.537\n728\t        emb_delta_pp: 0.8\n729\t      tau_020:\n730\t        random_R1: 0.521\n731\t        embedding_R1: 0.526\n732\t        dataflow_R1: 0.52\n733\t        emb_delta_pp: 0.5\n734\t    starcoder:\n735\t      tau_005:\n736\t        random_R1: 0.443\n737\t        embedding_R1: 0.45\n738\t        dataflow_R1: 0.437\n739\t        emb_delta_pp: 0.7\n740\t      tau_010:\n741\t        random_R1: 0.451\n742\t        embedding_R1: 0.457\n743\t        dataflow_R1: 0.446\n744\t        emb_delta_pp: 0.6\n745\t      tau_020:\n746\t        random_R1: 0.435\n747\t        embedding_R1: 0.438\n748\t        dataflow_R1: 0.43\n749\t        emb_delta_pp: 0.3\n750\t    optimal_tau: 0.1\n751\t    strategy_ranking_preserved_across_tau: true\n752\t    delta_shrinks_at_high_tau: true\n753\t  result_rationale: 'τ=0.05（当前默认）可能过低：contrastive loss 的 gradient 过于 sharp，模型对 hard\n754\t    negatives 过度 sensitive，导致 overfitting（plan_002 中 step 500 后即 overfit）。 τ=0.1 在\n755\t    median 档下反而略好：gradient 更 smooth，模型更 robust，absolute R@1 比 τ=0.05 高 ~0.7pp（Qwen）和\n756\t    ~0.8pp（StarCoder）。但 strategy delta 在 τ=0.1 时略小（0.8pp vs 1.0pp Qwen），因为 smoother\n757\t    gradient 也 smooth 掉了 hard negative 的 extra signal。τ=0.2 过高：loss landscape 太 flat，training\n758\t    signal 不足， all strategies 退化。关键发现：strategy ranking（embedding > random ≥ dataflow）\n759\t    在所有 τ 下保持一致，说明 finding 不是 regime-specific。但 delta 随 τ 增大而 缩小，表明在 optimal τ 下 effect\n760\t    size 可能更小。这是 median 档的典型 pattern： finding 方向 robust 但 magnitude 依赖 hyperparameter。\n761\t\n762\t    '\n763\t  tables:\n764\t  - name: 'Table: R@1 by Temperature × Strategy (Qwen)'\n765\t    columns:\n766\t    - τ\n767\t    - Random\n768\t    - Embedding\n769\t    - Dataflow\n770\t    - Emb Δ (pp)\n771\t    - Best strat\n772\t    rows:\n773\t    - - 0.05\n774\t      - 0.53\n775\t      - 0.54\n776\t      - 0.532\n777\t      - '+1.0'\n778\t      - embedding\n779\t    - - 0.1\n780\t      - 0.537\n781\t      - 0.545\n782\t      - 0.537\n783\t      - '+0.8'\n784\t      - embedding\n785\t    - - 0.2\n786\t      - 0.521\n787\t      - 0.526\n788\t      - 0.52\n789\t      - '+0.5'\n790\t      - embedding\n791\t  - name: 'Table: R@1 by Temperature × Strategy (StarCoder)'\n792\t    columns:\n793\t    - τ\n794\t    - Random\n795\t    - Embedding\n796\t    - Dataflow\n797\t    - Emb Δ (pp)\n798\t    - Best strat\n799\t    rows:\n800\t    - - 0.05\n801\t      - 0.443\n802\t      - 0.45\n803\t      - 0.437\n804\t      - '+0.7'\n805\t      - embedding\n806\t    - - 0.1\n807\t      - 0.451\n808\t      - 0.457\n809\t      - 0.446\n810\t      - '+0.6'\n811\t      - embedding\n812\t    - - 0.2\n813\t      - 0.435\n814\t      - 0.438\n815\t      - 0.43\n816\t      - '+0.3'\n817\t      - embedding\n818\t  figures_description:\n819\t  - 'Line plot: R@1 vs τ for each strategy, dual-panel (Qwen | StarCoder). All strategies\n820\t    show inverted-U with peak at τ=0.1. Embedding line consistently above random.'\n821\t  - 'Bar chart: embedding delta (pp) vs τ. Monotonically decreasing from τ=0.05 to\n822\t    τ=0.2, showing that harder temperature amplifies strategy differences.'\n823\t  analysis: 'Temperature ablation 提供两个 key findings：(1) strategy ranking 在 τ 范围内 preserved（robustness\n824\t    check passed），(2) optimal τ 可能是 0.1 而非 0.05，但在 optimal τ 下 embedding delta 只有\n825\t    0.6-0.8pp。这要求论文报告 best-τ 结果时 acknowledge effect size 进一步缩小。建议报告 τ=0.05 作为 primary（与\n826\t    prior work 对齐）加 τ sensitivity 在 appendix。如果 reviewer 质疑 regime-specificity， 可以\n827\t    argue ranking preserved 但 concede magnitude is τ-dependent。\n828\t\n829\t    '\n830\t- name: Dynamic vs Static Embedding Mining\n831\t  plan_id: plan_015\n832\t  description: Dynamic re-mine embedding negatives per epoch vs static (mine once\n833\t    from pretrained), Qwen encoder\n834\t  expected_results:\n835\t    qwen_static_emb_R1: 0.54\n836\t    qwen_dynamic_emb_R1: 0.544\n837\t    dynamic_minus_static_pp: 0.4\n838\t    dynamic_minus_static_CI:\n839\t    - -0.8\n840\t    - 1.6\n841\t    training_time_ratio_dynamic_vs_static: 2.3\n842\t  result_rationale: 'Dynamic mining 每个 epoch 用 current encoder 重新计算 embeddings 并 re-mine\n843\t    negatives，理论上 negatives 始终 adaptive to current model state。但在 median 档下 static\n844\t    mining 本身 effect size 就小（+1.0pp），dynamic 的 incremental gain 仅 +0.4pp，因为 (1) training\n845\t    只跑 2-3 epochs，encoder 变化不大，re-mining 的 negatives 与 static 的 overlap 很大（estimated\n846\t    > 80% overlap），(2) dynamic mining 需要 per-epoch full-corpus encoding，training time\n847\t    翻 2.3x，cost-benefit 不划算。CI 包含 0，说明 gain 不 significant。这个结果也部分缓解了 \"static mining\n848\t    confound\" 的 reviewer concern：dynamic 没有 dramatically 改变 picture。\n849\t\n850\t    '\n851\t  tables:\n852\t  - name: 'Table: Static vs Dynamic Embedding Mining (Qwen)'\n853\t    columns:\n854\t    - Mining\n855\t    - R@1\n856\t    - Δ vs static (pp)\n857\t    - Train time (h)\n858\t    - CI\n859\t    rows:\n860\t    - - static\n861\t      - 0.54\n862\t      - —\n863\t      - 7.5\n864\t      - —\n865\t    - - dynamic\n866\t      - 0.544\n867\t      - '+0.4'\n868\t      - 17.3\n869\t      - '[-0.8, 1.6]'\n870\t  figures_description:\n871\t  - 'Bar chart: R@1 for static vs dynamic with CI error bars. Bars nearly equal height\n872\t    with overlapping CIs.'\n873\t  - 'Venn diagram or overlap histogram: negative set overlap between static and dynamic\n874\t    at epoch 1, 2, 3. Shows > 80% overlap at all epochs.'\n875\t  analysis: 'Dynamic mining 是 expensive 的 marginal improvement。论文中一句话 dismiss this\n876\t    confound：\"We additionally tested dynamic re-mining (per-epoch) and found no significant\n877\t    improvement over static mining (Δ=+0.4pp, p=0.38), likely because the encoder\n878\t    changes minimally over 2-3 epochs.\"\n879\t\n880\t    '\n881\t- name: Bootstrap CI for SWE-bench Resolve Rate\n882\t  plan_id: plan_016\n883\t  description: 95% bootstrap confidence intervals for all strategy comparisons on\n884\t    SWE-bench Lite\n885\t  expected_results:\n886\t    n_bootstrap_samples: 10000\n887\t    random_resolve_rate_pct: 23.0\n888\t    random_CI:\n889\t    - 18.3\n890\t    - 27.7\n891\t    embedding_resolve_rate_pct: 23.7\n892\t    embedding_CI:\n893\t    - 18.7\n894\t    - 28.3\n895\t    dataflow_resolve_rate_pct: 23.3\n896\t    dataflow_CI:\n897\t    - 18.3\n898\t    - 28.0\n899\t    emb_minus_random_delta_pp: 0.7\n900\t    emb_minus_random_CI:\n901\t    - -3.2\n902\t    - 4.5\n903\t    emb_minus_random_p_value: 0.62\n904\t    df_minus_random_delta_pp: 0.3\n905\t    df_minus_random_CI:\n906\t    - -3.8\n907\t    - 4.4\n908\t    df_minus_random_p_value: 0.78\n909\t    any_comparison_significant: false\n910\t  result_rationale: 'N=300 binary outcomes（resolve/not-resolve）的 bootstrap CI 很宽：individual\n911\t    strategy 的 CI width ~9.5pp，paired delta 的 CI width ~7.7pp。这是因为 binary outcome\n912\t    的 variance 最大（Bernoulli variance = p(1-p) ≈ 0.18），300 instances 给出的 standard error\n913\t    ≈ sqrt(0.18/300) ≈ 0.024 = 2.4pp，95% CI ≈ ±4.7pp。 在 delta < 1pp 的情况下，不可能 achieve\n914\t    significance。这是 fundamental power limitation，不是方法问题。Even with 3000 instances (full\n915\t    SWE-bench)，delta 0.7pp 仍需要 N > 15000 才能 detect with 80% power。\n916\t\n917\t    '\n918\t  tables:\n919\t  - name: 'Table: SWE-bench Bootstrap CIs'\n920\t    columns:\n921\t    - Comparison\n922\t    - Δ (pp)\n923\t    - 95% CI\n924\t    - p-value\n925\t    - Significant?\n926\t    rows:\n927\t    - - emb − random\n928\t      - '+0.7'\n929\t      - '[-3.2, 4.5]'\n930\t      - 0.62\n931\t      - 'No'\n932\t    - - df − random\n933\t      - '+0.3'\n934\t      - '[-3.8, 4.4]'\n935\t      - 0.78\n936\t      - 'No'\n937\t    - - emb − df\n938\t      - '+0.3'\n939\t      - '[-3.5, 4.2]'\n940\t      - 0.73\n941\t      - 'No'\n942\t  figures_description:\n943\t  - 'Forest plot: paired delta with 95% CI for each comparison. All CIs cross zero,\n944\t    none close to significance.'\n945\t  - 'Power analysis curve: required N to detect Δ=0.7pp at 80% power. Shows N > 15000,\n946\t    far beyond SWE-bench Lite''s 300.'\n947\t  analysis: 'SWE-bench CIs 确认 end-to-end evaluation 对 retrieval strategy 的 sensitivity\n948\t    不足。这不是 negative result 而是 power limitation。论文中必须 transparently 报告 \"SWE-bench evaluation\n949\t    confirms no strategy harms downstream performance, but the benchmark is underpowered\n950\t    to detect the retrieval-stage deltas we observe (< 1pp)\"。Power analysis figure\n951\t    可放入 appendix 支撑此 argument。\n952\t\n953\t    '\n954\t- name: Inference-Time Graph Method Literature Comparison\n955\t  plan_id: plan_017\n956\t  description: Analysis-only comparison with CodexGraph, LocAgent, RANGER etc. (no\n957\t    experiment)\n958\t  expected_results:\n959\t    papers_compared: 8\n960\t    key_distinction: training-time mining vs inference-time navigation\n961\t    complementary_not_competing: true\n962\t    overlap_with_our_approach: minimal — they inject structure at inference, we use\n963\t      structure for training data curation\n964\t  result_rationale: '8 篇 inference-time graph 方法（CodexGraph, LocAgent, RANGER, GraphCoder,\n965\t    ARISE, RepoGraph, CodeGRAG, CodeRAG）都在 inference 时构建或查询 code graph。与 StructFuse\n966\t    的区别是 fundamental：我们在 training time 用 graph 选 negatives，他们在 inference time 用 graph\n967\t    navigate。二者理论上 complementary（可以用 StructFuse 训练的 retriever 作为这些 inference-time\n968\t    methods 的 backbone）。但 median 档下我们 没有实验验证 complementarity，只能 argue in principle。这个\n969\t    literature gap 在 前几轮 review 中被 flagged（best-R2-W5），written comparison 应该足够 address。\n970\t\n971\t    '\n972\t  tables:\n973\t  - name: 'Table: Comparison with Inference-Time Graph Methods'\n974\t    columns:\n975\t    - Method\n976\t    - Graph type\n977\t    - When used\n978\t    - Scope\n979\t    - Complementary?\n980\t    rows:\n981\t    - - CodexGraph\n982\t      - Repository graph\n983\t      - Inference\n984\t      - Navigation\n985\t      - 'Yes'\n986\t    - - LocAgent\n987\t      - Code structure\n988\t      - Inference\n989\t      - Localization\n990\t      - 'Yes'\n991\t    - - RANGER\n992\t      - AST + deps\n993\t      - Inference\n994\t      - Ranking\n995\t      - 'Yes'\n996\t    - - StructFuse (ours)\n997\t      - Dataflow\n998\t      - Training\n999\t      - Neg mining\n1000\t      - —\n1001\t  figures_description:\n1002\t  - 'Taxonomy diagram: 2×2 matrix of (training/inference) × (text-only/structure-enhanced)\n1003\t    methods, positioning StructFuse in the training+structure quadrant alongside ANCE/curriculum\n1004\t    mining in training+text.'\n1005\t  analysis: 'Discussion section 需要明确 position StructFuse 为 complementary approach，not\n1006\t    competing with inference-time methods。这也为 future work 提供了 natural extension： combine\n1007\t    StructFuse-trained retriever with inference-time graph navigation。 Median 档下这是\n1008\t    speculative future work 而非 verified claim。\n1009\t\n1010\t    '\n1011\t- name: BM25 Hard Negative Baseline\n1012\t  plan_id: plan_018\n1013\t  description: BM25-based hard negatives as 4th strategy, 1 seed × 2 encoders, compare\n1014\t    with random/embedding/dataflow\n1015\t  expected_results:\n1016\t    qwen_bm25_R1: 0.521\n1017\t    qwen_random_R1: 0.53\n1018\t    qwen_embedding_R1: 0.54\n1019\t    qwen_bm25_minus_random_pp: -0.9\n1020\t    qwen_bm25_minus_random_CI:\n1021\t    - -2.8\n1022\t    - 1.0\n1023\t    qwen_bm25_minus_random_p_value: 0.12\n1024\t    starcoder_bm25_R1: 0.436\n1025\t    starcoder_random_R1: 0.443\n1026\t    starcoder_embedding_R1: 0.45\n1027\t    starcoder_bm25_minus_random_pp: -0.7\n1028\t    starcoder_bm25_minus_random_CI:\n1029\t    - -2.5\n1030\t    - 1.1\n1031\t    starcoder_bm25_minus_random_p_value: 0.18\n1032\t    bm25_rank: worst among 4 strategies\n1033\t    bm25_vs_embedding_delta_pp_qwen: -1.9\n1034\t    bm25_vs_embedding_delta_pp_starcoder: -1.4\n1035\t  result_rationale: 'BM25 negatives 是 lexical-similarity top-k，与 true embedding distance\n1036\t    negatives 的 selection 方式 fundamentally 不同。BM25 top-k 主要 capture keyword overlap\n1037\t    （function names, import statements），这些 \"negatives\" 中很多实际上是 semantically related（可能包含\n1038\t    false negatives / actual positives mislabeled as negatives）， 导致 noisy training\n1039\t    signal。在 median 档下，BM25 harm 方向正确（-0.9pp Qwen, -0.7pp StarCoder），但 delta 小于 CoCoHaNeRe\n1040\t    报告的 -27pp。原因：(1) 我们的 training pipeline 更 robust（proper temperature, early stopping），(2)\n1041\t    pool=50 限制了 BM25 negatives 的 \"hardness\"（不像 CoCoHaNeRe 的 full-corpus mining）。 p\n1042\t    > 0.05 说明 harm 不 significant，but direction is consistent。这 partially closes the\n1043\t    correction argument：可以 say \"BM25-proxy negatives harm in the direction CoCoHaNeRe\n1044\t    reports, but the magnitude in our controlled setup is much smaller, suggesting\n1045\t    their -27pp included other confounds beyond negative source\"。 不能 fully close（p\n1046\t    > 0.05），只能 partially support。\n1047\t\n1048\t    '\n1049\t  tables:\n1050\t  - name: 'Table: 4-Strategy Comparison R@1'\n1051\t    columns:\n1052\t    - Strategy\n1053\t    - Qwen R@1\n1054\t    - StarCoder R@1\n1055\t    - Qwen Δ vs Random\n1056\t    - StarCoder Δ vs Random\n1057\t    rows:\n1058\t    - - random\n1059\t      - 0.53\n1060\t      - 0.443\n1061\t      - —\n1062\t      - —\n1063\t    - - embedding\n1064\t      - 0.54\n1065\t      - 0.45\n1066\t      - '+1.0'\n1067\t      - '+0.7'\n1068\t    - - dataflow\n1069\t      - 0.532\n1070\t      - 0.437\n1071\t      - '+0.2'\n1072\t      - −0.6\n1073\t    - - BM25\n1074\t      - 0.521\n1075\t      - 0.436\n1076\t      - −0.9\n1077\t      - −0.7\n1078\t  - name: 'Table: BM25 vs Embedding Delta (the CoCoHaNeRe gap)'\n1079\t    columns:\n1080\t    - Encoder\n1081\t    - BM25 R@1\n1082\t    - Emb R@1\n1083\t    - Δ (pp)\n1084\t    - CoCoHaNeRe reported\n1085\t    - Our explanation\n1086\t    rows:\n1087\t    - - Qwen\n1088\t      - 0.521\n1089\t      - 0.54\n1090\t      - −1.9\n1091\t      - −27\n1092\t      - Different mining protocol, pool size, pipeline robustness\n1093\t    - - StarCoder\n1094\t      - 0.436\n1095\t      - 0.45\n1096\t      - −1.4\n1097\t      - n/a\n1098\t      - Consistent direction, smaller magnitude\n1099\t  figures_description:\n1100\t  - 'Bar chart: R@1 for 4 strategies × 2 encoders. BM25 bar clearly lowest, embedding\n1101\t    highest. Error bars (1-seed, bootstrap over eval set) show BM25 CI overlapping\n1102\t    random.'\n1103\t  - 'Scatter plot: per-query BM25-negative similarity vs embedding-negative similarity,\n1104\t    colored by whether query was correctly retrieved. Shows that BM25 negatives cluster\n1105\t    in a different similarity region (high lexical, medium semantic) than embedding\n1106\t    negatives (high semantic).'\n1107\t  - 'Venn diagram: overlap between BM25 top-5 negatives and embedding top-5 negatives.\n1108\t    Shows ~30% overlap, confirming they are selecting different negative populations.'\n1109\t  analysis: 'BM25 baseline 是 median 档下最重要的新增实验。它 partially 但不 fully closes the CoCoHaNeRe\n1110\t    correction argument。方向一致（BM25 harm, embedding help）支撑了 \"proxy conflation\" 的 narrative，但\n1111\t    delta 太小（-0.9pp vs -27pp）且 p > 0.05 意味着 argument 需要 soften。论文叙事从 \"we prove CoCoHaNeRe\n1112\t    was wrong\" 调整为 \"we observe that BM25-proxy negatives trend toward harm while true\n1113\t    embedding negatives trend toward benefit, consistent with the hypothesis that\n1114\t    CoCoHaNeRe''s reported -27pp harm was amplified by proxy conflation and other\n1115\t    uncontrolled factors\"。这是 median 档 framing 的核心转变。Need related work 深度对比 （ANCE,\n1116\t    curriculum mining, DPR hard negatives）来 contextualize 为什么 effect size 在 code domain\n1117\t    普遍 modest。\n1118\t\n1119\t    '\n1120\t- name: Pool Size Sensitivity Analysis\n1121\t  plan_id: plan_019\n1122\t  description: Strategy ranking stability at pool={50, 100, 200, 500} on SWE-smith\n1123\t    validation\n1124\t  expected_results:\n1125\t    qwen:\n1126\t      pool_50:\n1127\t        random_R1: 0.53\n1128\t        embedding_R1: 0.54\n1129\t        dataflow_R1: 0.532\n1130\t        ranking: emb > df > rand\n1131\t      pool_100:\n1132\t        random_R1: 0.412\n1133\t        embedding_R1: 0.421\n1134\t        dataflow_R1: 0.413\n1135\t        ranking: emb > df ≈ rand\n1136\t      pool_200:\n1137\t        random_R1: 0.328\n1138\t        embedding_R1: 0.335\n1139\t        dataflow_R1: 0.33\n1140\t        ranking: emb > df ≈ rand\n1141\t      pool_500:\n1142\t        random_R1: 0.241\n1143\t        embedding_R1: 0.246\n1144\t        dataflow_R1: 0.244\n1145\t        ranking: emb ≈ df ≈ rand\n1146\t    starcoder:\n1147\t      pool_50:\n1148\t        random_R1: 0.443\n1149\t        embedding_R1: 0.45\n1150\t        dataflow_R1: 0.437\n1151\t        ranking: emb > rand > df\n1152\t      pool_100:\n1153\t        random_R1: 0.339\n1154\t        embedding_R1: 0.345\n1155\t        dataflow_R1: 0.334\n1156\t        ranking: emb > rand > df\n1157\t      pool_200:\n1158\t        random_R1: 0.268\n1159\t        embedding_R1: 0.272\n1160\t        dataflow_R1: 0.271\n1161\t        ranking: emb ≈ df ≈ rand\n1162\t      pool_500:\n1163\t        random_R1: 0.194\n1164\t        embedding_R1: 0.196\n1165\t        dataflow_R1: 0.197\n1166\t        ranking: df ≈ emb ≈ rand\n1167\t    pool_ranking_stable_pct: 62.5\n1168\t    ranking_crossover_threshold: pool ≥ 200\n1169\t    absolute_R1_decline_per_10x_pool: 0.18\n1170\t  result_rationale: 'Pool size 增大时所有 strategies 的 absolute R@1 大幅下降（从 pool=50 的 ~53%\n1171\t    到 pool=500 的 ~24%），因为 retrieval 的 baseline difficulty 增加。Strategy delta 也随 pool\n1172\t    增大而压缩：pool=50 时 embedding delta=+1.0pp，pool=500 时仅 +0.5pp。 原因是大 pool 中 distractors\n1173\t    更 diverse，training-time 的 hard negative strategy 只 prepare 了模型应对特定 difficulty\n1174\t    分布，但 pool=500 时 test-time 的 difficulty distribution 超出了 training-time 的 coverage。在\n1175\t    pool ≥ 200 时偶有 ranking 交叉（StarCoder pool=500 时 dataflow 反超 embedding by 0.1pp），但差异在\n1176\t    noise range 内。Overall ranking stability 62.5%（8 个 encoder×pool 组合中 5 个保持 embedding\n1177\t    > rest），低于 best 档的 >80% 但高于 worst 档的 <50%。这说明 finding \"directionally holds but\n1178\t    weakens\" at larger pools，需在论文中 caveat。\n1179\t\n1180\t    '\n1181\t  tables:\n1182\t  - name: 'Table: R@1 by Pool Size × Strategy (Qwen)'\n1183\t    columns:\n1184\t    - Pool\n1185\t    - Random\n1186\t    - Embedding\n1187\t    - Dataflow\n1188\t    - Emb Δ (pp)\n1189\t    - Ranking stable?\n1190\t    rows:\n1191\t    - - 50\n1192\t      - 0.53\n1193\t      - 0.54\n1194\t      - 0.532\n1195\t      - '+1.0'\n1196\t      - ✓\n1197\t    - - 100\n1198\t      - 0.412\n1199\t      - 0.421\n1200\t      - 0.413\n1201\t      - '+0.9'\n1202\t      - ✓\n1203\t    - - 200\n1204\t      - 0.328\n1205\t      - 0.335\n1206\t      - 0.33\n1207\t      - '+0.7'\n1208\t      - ✓\n1209\t    - - 500\n1210\t      - 0.241\n1211\t      - 0.246\n1212\t      - 0.244\n1213\t      - '+0.5'\n1214\t      - ✓\n1215\t  - name: 'Table: R@1 by Pool Size × Strategy (StarCoder)'\n1216\t    columns:\n1217\t    - Pool\n1218\t    - Random\n1219\t    - Embedding\n1220\t    - Dataflow\n1221\t    - Emb Δ (pp)\n1222\t    - Ranking stable?\n1223\t    rows:\n1224\t    - - 50\n1225\t      - 0.443\n1226\t      - 0.45\n1227\t      - 0.437\n1228\t      - '+0.7'\n1229\t      - ✓\n1230\t    - - 100\n1231\t      - 0.339\n1232\t      - 0.345\n1233\t      - 0.334\n1234\t      - '+0.6'\n1235\t      - ✓\n1236\t    - - 200\n1237\t      - 0.268\n1238\t      - 0.272\n1239\t      - 0.271\n1240\t      - '+0.4'\n1241\t      - '~'\n1242\t    - - 500\n1243\t      - 0.194\n1244\t      - 0.196\n1245\t      - 0.197\n1246\t      - '+0.2'\n1247\t      - ✗\n1248\t  figures_description:\n1249\t  - 'Line plot: R@1 vs pool size (log scale) for each strategy, dual-panel (Qwen |\n1250\t    StarCoder). All lines decline; strategy gap narrows visibly at pool ≥ 200.'\n1251\t  - 'Delta plot: embedding−random delta (pp) vs pool size. Monotonically declining\n1252\t    curve, approaching zero at pool = 500.'\n1253\t  - 'Heatmap: strategy ranking (1st/2nd/3rd) at each pool size × encoder. Transition\n1254\t    from stable ranking at pool ≤ 100 to unstable at pool ≥ 200.'\n1255\t  analysis: Pool size sensitivity 是 median 档下最重要的 external validity check。结果显示 embedding\n1256\t    mining 优势 real 但 diminishing with pool size。论文需要 honestly discuss：(1) pool=50\n1257\t    是 validation setup，real-world repo pool 通常 200-1000+， (2) at realistic pool sizes\n1258\t    the advantage shrinks to ~0.5pp。这强化了 \"systematic study\" 而非 \"strong method contribution\"\n1259\t    的 positioning。建议在 main paper 中报告 pool=50 和 pool=200 的双 benchmark，并在 limitation\n1260\t    中讨论 pool=500 的 convergence。\n1261\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a45356f-658c-4c4f-ba94-f04e8cd4eef3","uuid":"dc0a2ba7-6967-4f87-acca-508d649b5942","timestamp":"2026-05-14T17:06:16.687Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/structfuse-context/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T162530/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 降级为 \"tends to help\"：embedding mining 方向正确但 effect size\n  缩水约 50%， 多 seed CI 宽（2–4pp），个别 seed delta < 0.5pp。BM25 baseline 方向一致（harm）但 delta\n  小且 p > 0.05，CoCoHaNeRe correction 论证从 \"empirically verified\" 改为 \"BM25 proxy 方向一致但\n  effect size 不足以排除混杂\"。Claim 2 降级为 exploratory observation：dataflow 在 Qwen 上 CI 包含\n  0，StarCoder 上方向为负，合并进 Claim 1 作为 strategy-encoder interaction case。SWE-bench delta\n  < 1pp 且 CI 包含 0， 无法作为独立 evidence。论文重心移向 systematic empirical comparison + representation\n  geometry analysis。标题用 \"Systematic Study\"，定位 analysis paper。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: SWE-bench Lite End-to-End Evaluation\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: 3 strategies × best checkpoint (Qwen), Qwen3.6-27B agent, 300 SWE-bench\n    Lite instances\n  expected_results:\n    random_resolve_rate_pct: 23.0\n    random_resolved_count: 69\n    embedding_resolve_rate_pct: 23.7\n    embedding_resolved_count: 71\n    dataflow_resolve_rate_pct: 23.3\n    dataflow_resolved_count: 70\n    emb_minus_random_delta_pp: 0.7\n    df_minus_random_delta_pp: 0.3\n    total_instances: 300\n    retrieval_R1_on_swebench_random: 0.41\n    retrieval_R1_on_swebench_embedding: 0.42\n    retrieval_R1_on_swebench_dataflow: 0.41\n  result_rationale: 'SWE-bench Lite 的 resolve rate 由 agent 生成能力主导，retrieval 只是 pipeline\n    的第一步。median 档下 retrieval R@1 delta 仅 ~1pp，传导到 end-to-end 后进一步 衰减：即使 retrieval\n    多找对 1-2 个 file，agent 是否能利用这个 file 生成正确 patch 是独立的噪声源。300 instances 上 2 个 count\n    的差异对应 ~0.7pp，远不够 statistical significance。此外 SWE-bench 的 repo 分布与 SWE-smith training\n    分布有 domain shift， 进一步压缩了 retrieval improvement 的传导效率。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: SWE-bench Lite Resolve Rate by Strategy'\n    columns:\n    - Strategy\n    - Resolved\n    - Total\n    - Rate (%)\n    - Δ vs Random (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - random\n      - 69\n      - 300\n      - 23.0\n      - —\n    - - embedding\n      - 71\n      - 300\n      - 23.7\n      - '+0.7'\n    - - dataflow\n      - 70\n      - 300\n      - 23.3\n      - '+0.3'\n  - name: 'Table: Retrieval-Stage R@1 on SWE-bench Repos'\n    columns:\n    - Strategy\n    - R@1\n    - R@5\n    rows:\n    - - random\n      - 0.41\n      - 0.78\n    - - embedding\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.79\n    - - dataflow\n      - 0.41\n      - 0.78\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: resolve rate by strategy with 95% bootstrap CI error bars. All three\n    bars overlap heavily, CI bands span ~4pp each.'\n  - 'Scatter plot: per-instance retrieval correctness vs resolve outcome, colored\n    by strategy. Shows that retrieval success is necessary but not sufficient — many\n    correctly-retrieved instances still fail at generation.'\n  analysis: 'SWE-bench delta 不足以支撑独立 claim。resolve rate 差异 < 1pp，在 N=300 上无统计 显著性（见\n    plan_016）。Retrieval-stage R@1 差异同样微小（~1pp），说明 SWE-smith 到 SWE-bench 的 domain gap\n    进一步压平了 strategy 差异。论文中应作为 \"sanity check\" 而非 primary evidence 呈现：确认 negative mining\n    策略不 harm downstream performance， 但不能 claim 显著 improvement。需在 limitation 中讨论 300\n    instances 的 power 不足问题。\n\n    '\n- name: RepoBench-R Cross-File Retrieval Evaluation\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: 3 strategies × 3 seeds × 2 encoders, RepoBench-R test_easy (8K, pool~6)\n    + test_hard (8K, pool~18), with 95% CIs\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_test_easy:\n      random_R1_mean: 0.682\n      embedding_R1_mean: 0.688\n      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.685\n      emb_minus_random_pp: 0.6\n      emb_minus_random_CI:\n      - -0.2\n      - 1.4\n    qwen_test_hard:\n      random_R1_mean: 0.394\n      embedding_R1_mean: 0.404\n      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.398\n      emb_minus_random_pp: 1.0\n      emb_minus_random_CI:\n      - -0.1\n      - 2.1\n    starcoder_test_easy:\n      random_R1_mean: 0.621\n      embedding_R1_mean: 0.626\n      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.618\n      emb_minus_random_pp: 0.5\n      emb_minus_random_CI:\n      - -0.3\n      - 1.3\n    starcoder_test_hard:\n      random_R1_mean: 0.338\n      embedding_R1_mean: 0.346\n      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.333\n      emb_minus_random_pp: 0.8\n      emb_minus_random_CI:\n      - -0.4\n      - 2.0\n    overall_delta_pp_range:\n    - 0.0\n    - 1.5\n  result_rationale: 'RepoBench-R 的 test_easy pool 仅 ~6 candidates，所有策略接近 ceiling，strategy\n    差异被压缩到 < 1pp。test_hard pool ~18 提供更多区分空间，delta 稍大（~1pp）但仍在 CI 包含 0 的边缘。RepoBench-R\n    与 SWE-smith 的 task 定义不同（cross-file completion vs bug-fix retrieval），domain shift\n    进一步削弱了 training-time strategy 差异的 传导。8K instances 的大样本量使 per-strategy CI 较窄（~1.5pp\n    width），但 delta 的 CI 仍 ~2pp width，因为 strategy 间的 paired variance 较大。Dataflow 在\n    StarCoder 上一致为负（-0.5pp），符合 pilot 发现的 encoder-strategy interaction pattern。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: RepoBench-R R@1 by Strategy × Encoder × Difficulty'\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - Split\n    - Random\n    - Embedding\n    - Dataflow\n    - Emb Δ (pp)\n    - DF Δ (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - easy\n      - 68.2 ± 0.7\n      - 68.8 ± 0.8\n      - 68.5 ± 0.9\n      - '+0.6'\n      - '+0.3'\n    - - Qwen\n      - hard\n      - 39.4 ± 1.0\n      - 40.4 ± 1.1\n      - 39.8 ± 1.2\n      - '+1.0'\n      - '+0.4'\n    - - StarCoder\n      - easy\n      - 62.1 ± 0.6\n      - 62.6 ± 0.7\n      - 61.8 ± 0.8\n      - '+0.5'\n      - −0.3\n    - - StarCoder\n      - hard\n      - 33.8 ± 0.9\n      - 34.6 ± 1.0\n      - 33.3 ± 1.1\n      - '+0.8'\n      - −0.5\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart: R@1 by strategy for each (encoder × split) combination, with\n    95% seed-level CI error bars. Easy splits visually flat, hard splits show small\n    embedding advantage with overlapping CIs.'\n  - 'Delta plot (forest plot style): embedding-random and dataflow-random deltas with\n    CIs for each (encoder × split). Most CIs cross zero; Qwen hard is the only condition\n    where the lower bound approaches 0.'\n  analysis: 'RepoBench-R 提供了 second benchmark 覆盖，方向一致（embedding ≥ random > dataflow\n    on StarCoder），但 effect size 不足以独立支撑 claim。test_hard 上的 delta 稍大， 说明 pool size\n    对 strategy 效果有调节作用（与 plan_019 呼应）。论文中报告为 \"directional consistency across benchmarks\"\n    而非 \"significant improvement on second benchmark\"。CIs 需在 Table 中完整展示以示 transparency。\n\n    '\n- name: Stratified Retrieval Analysis (5 Strata)\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: 分层分析：repo size / pool size / query-pos similarity / structural data\n    availability / neg_difficulty quartile\n  expected_results:\n    stratum_1_repo_size:\n      small_lt50_emb_delta_pp: 1.8\n      medium_50_200_emb_delta_pp: 1.2\n      large_200_500_emb_delta_pp: 0.6\n      xlarge_500plus_emb_delta_pp: 0.4\n    stratum_2_pool_size:\n      pool_lt10_emb_delta_pp: 0.3\n      pool_10_50_emb_delta_pp: 1.1\n      pool_50plus_emb_delta_pp: 0.7\n    stratum_3_query_pos_sim:\n      high_sim_gt098_emb_delta_pp: 0.5\n      medium_sim_090_098_emb_delta_pp: 1.3\n      low_sim_lt090_emb_delta_pp: 1.0\n    stratum_4_structural_availability:\n      with_dataflow_34pct:\n        random_R1: 0.538\n        embedding_R1: 0.548\n        dataflow_R1: 0.544\n        df_minus_random_pp: 0.6\n        emb_minus_random_pp: 1.0\n      fallback_66pct:\n        random_R1: 0.526\n        embedding_R1: 0.536\n        dataflow_R1: 0.527\n        df_minus_random_pp: 0.1\n        emb_minus_random_pp: 1.0\n    stratum_5_neg_difficulty_quartile:\n      Q1_easiest:\n        emb_delta_pp: 0.3\n        df_delta_pp: -0.2\n      Q2:\n        emb_delta_pp: 0.8\n        df_delta_pp: 0.1\n      Q3:\n        emb_delta_pp: 1.4\n        df_delta_pp: 0.5\n      Q4_hardest:\n        emb_delta_pp: 1.6\n        df_delta_pp: 1.2\n  result_rationale: 'Repo size 分层：小 repo 的 pool 小、diversity 低，embedding mining 更容易找到有意义\n    的 hard negatives，所以 delta 最大。大 repo 中 pool 大但 noise 也大（更多 unrelated files），embedding\n    mining 优势被稀释。Pool size 分层与 repo size 部分共线但不完全： pool < 10 时 all strategies 接近 ceiling\n    所以 delta 小；pool 10-50 是 sweet spot； pool 50+ 时 noise 增加。Query-pos similarity 分层：high\n    sim (> 0.98，Qwen 主导) 表明 representation 已饱和，embedding negatives 不够 hard，delta 小；medium\n    sim 区间 embedding mining 最 effective。Structural availability 分层：34% 有 dataflow\n    数据的 instances 上 dataflow strategy 有 +0.6pp 优势（真正用到了 structural signal）， 但 66%\n    fallback instances 上 dataflow ≈ random（因为 fallback 到 random sampling）， 整体被 dilute。Neg\n    difficulty quartile：Q4（最难 negatives）时 embedding 和 dataflow 都 help 最多，因为这些 cases\n    正是模型最 confuse 的地方，harder negatives 提供最大 gradient signal。但 Q1-Q2 占比大，dilute 了整体\n    effect。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Embedding Delta by Repo Size Stratum (Qwen)'\n    columns:\n    - Stratum\n    - N instances\n    - Random R@1\n    - Emb R@1\n    - Δ (pp)\n    - 95% CI\n    rows:\n    - - small (<50)\n      - 500\n      - 0.571\n      - 0.589\n      - '+1.8'\n      - '[-0.5, 4.1]'\n    - - medium (50-200)\n      - 4096\n      - 0.542\n      - 0.554\n      - '+1.2'\n      - '[0.0, 2.4]'\n    - - large (200-500)\n      - 13628\n      - 0.531\n      - 0.537\n      - '+0.6'\n      - '[-0.3, 1.5]'\n    - - xlarge (500+)\n      - 25949\n      - 0.524\n      - 0.528\n      - '+0.4'\n      - '[-0.5, 1.3]'\n  - name: 'Table: Strategy Delta by Structural Data Availability (Qwen)'\n    columns:\n    - Stratum\n    - N\n    - Random R@1\n    - Emb R@1\n    - DF R@1\n    - Emb Δ\n    - DF Δ\n    rows:\n    - - with dataflow (34%)\n      - ~15K\n      - 0.538\n      - 0.548\n      - 0.544\n      - '+1.0'\n      - '+0.6'\n    - - fallback (66%)\n      - ~29K\n      - 0.526\n      - 0.536\n      - 0.527\n      - '+1.0'\n      - '+0.1'\n  - name: 'Table: Strategy Delta by Neg Difficulty Quartile (Qwen)'\n    columns:\n    - Quartile\n    - Margin range\n    - Emb Δ (pp)\n    - DF Δ (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Q1 (easiest)\n      - '> 0.15'\n      - '+0.3'\n      - −0.2\n    - - Q2\n      - 0.08–0.15\n      - '+0.8'\n      - '+0.1'\n    - - Q3\n      - 0.02–0.08\n      - '+1.4'\n      - '+0.5'\n    - - Q4 (hardest)\n      - < 0.02\n      - '+1.6'\n      - '+1.2'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Heatmap: strategy delta (pp) across (stratum × strategy) combinations. Color\n    intensity encodes delta magnitude. Shows clear gradient for neg_difficulty quartile\n    but noisy pattern for repo size.'\n  - 'Line plot: embedding delta vs pool size (continuous), with LOESS smoothing. Shows\n    inverted-U shape peaking at pool ~30-50, declining at pool > 100.'\n  - 'Stacked bar: proportion of instances in each stratum, overlaid with per-stratum\n    delta. Visualizes that the high-delta strata (small repo, Q4 difficulty) contain\n    few instances, explaining why overall delta is modest.'\n  analysis: '分层分析揭示了 effect size heterogeneity：embedding mining 在 small repo / high\n    difficulty / medium similarity 条件下效果最好，但这些条件在实际分布中占比小。 Structural availability\n    分层确认了 dataflow 的 conditional benefit 完全来自有 structural data 的 34%（delta +0.6pp），fallback\n    的 66% 贡献为零。这解释了为什么 overall dataflow delta 被 dilute 到接近 0。Neg difficulty quartile\n    分析提供了 最清晰的 mechanistic story：当 negatives 足够 hard（Q4），both strategies help； 当 negatives\n    太 easy（Q1），neither helps much。这支持 representation geometry explanation 但 effect\n    size 不足以作为独立 claim。\n\n    '\n- name: Call-Graph Hop-Count Ablation\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: 1-hop vs 2-hop vs 3-hop call-graph bounding for dataflow negative selection\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_1hop_df_R1: 0.53\n    qwen_2hop_df_R1: 0.532\n    qwen_3hop_df_R1: 0.529\n    starcoder_1hop_df_R1: 0.434\n    starcoder_2hop_df_R1: 0.437\n    starcoder_3hop_df_R1: 0.436\n    qwen_2hop_minus_1hop_pp: 0.2\n    qwen_2hop_minus_3hop_pp: 0.3\n    eligible_negatives_per_query:\n      hop_1: 3.2\n      hop_2: 8.7\n      hop_3: 14.1\n    fallback_to_random_pct:\n      hop_1: 42\n      hop_2: 28\n      hop_3: 18\n  result_rationale: '1-hop 限制太严格：平均每 query 只有 3.2 个 eligible dataflow-disconnected\n    negatives， 42% 的 queries 不得不 fallback 到 random，稀释了 structural signal。2-hop 是 precision-recall\n    sweet spot：8.7 eligible negatives 足够采样，fallback 率降到 28%。 3-hop 进一步扩大 candidate\n    pool 但引入 semantically distant files（3-hop 以外的 files 很可能本来就和 query 无关），负 signal\n    质量下降，反而略差于 2-hop。但三者 差异均 < 0.5pp，在 noise range 内，不构成 strong ablation signal。这也反映了\n    median 档下 dataflow strategy 本身 effect size 就小，hop-count 作为 second-order effect\n    自然更小。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Dataflow R@1 by Hop Count'\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - 1-hop\n    - 2-hop\n    - 3-hop\n    - Best\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - 0.53\n      - 0.532\n      - 0.529\n      - 2-hop\n    - - StarCoder\n      - 0.434\n      - 0.437\n      - 0.436\n      - 2-hop\n  - name: 'Table: Negative Pool Statistics by Hop Count'\n    columns:\n    - Hops\n    - Mean eligible neg/query\n    - Fallback-to-random %\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - 3.2\n      - 42%\n    - - 2\n      - 8.7\n      - 28%\n    - - 3\n      - 14.1\n      - 18%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: R@1 vs hop count (1, 2, 3) for both encoders. Nearly flat lines with\n    error bars overlapping, showing 2-hop is marginally best.'\n  - 'Histogram: distribution of eligible negatives per query at each hop count. 1-hop\n    heavily left-skewed (many zeros), 2-hop more balanced, 3-hop right-shifted.'\n  analysis: '2-hop 作为默认设置是合理的，但 ablation signal 太弱（< 0.5pp）无法 claim hop count 是 critical\n    design choice。放入 appendix 作为 hyperparameter justification 即可。 更重要的 takeaway 是\n    1-hop 的 high fallback rate（42%），说明 inter-procedural dataflow 的 coverage 本身就有限——这与\n    plan_005 structural availability 分层的 34% 数字一致。\n\n    '\n- name: Training Data Size Scaling\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: 1K vs 3K vs 5K training instances × 3 strategies, Qwen encoder\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_1K:\n      random_R1: 0.498\n      embedding_R1: 0.501\n      dataflow_R1: 0.495\n      emb_delta_pp: 0.3\n    qwen_3K:\n      random_R1: 0.519\n      embedding_R1: 0.528\n      dataflow_R1: 0.521\n      emb_delta_pp: 0.9\n    qwen_5K:\n      random_R1: 0.53\n      embedding_R1: 0.54\n      dataflow_R1: 0.532\n      emb_delta_pp: 1.0\n    scaling_slope_R1_per_1K: 0.008\n  result_rationale: '1K instances 时所有策略都 underfit：training data 不足以让 contrastive loss\n    充分 学习，absolute R@1 低（~0.50）。Embedding mining 在 1K 时优势最小（+0.3pp）， 因为 1K instances\n    中 embedding-distance 的 top-k negatives 覆盖了 corpus 的较小 subset，mining quality 受限于\n    candidate pool diversity。3K 到 5K 的 scaling 呈 sub-linear 增长（+1.1pp absolute from\n    3K→5K vs +2.1pp from 1K→3K），说明 returns diminishing。Strategy delta 的 scaling 也\n    sub-linear：embedding 优势在 3K 时已接近 5K 水平。这表明 effect size 的上限由 pretrained representation\n    quality 决定，不会随 data 无限增大。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: R@1 by Data Size × Strategy (Qwen)'\n    columns:\n    - Size\n    - Random\n    - Embedding\n    - Dataflow\n    - Emb Δ (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - 1K\n      - 0.498\n      - 0.501\n      - 0.495\n      - '+0.3'\n    - - 3K\n      - 0.519\n      - 0.528\n      - 0.521\n      - '+0.9'\n    - - 5K (full)\n      - 0.53\n      - 0.54\n      - 0.532\n      - '+1.0'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: R@1 vs training size for each strategy. Three upward-sloping lines\n    with diminishing returns. Embedding line consistently above random but gap narrows\n    at 1K.'\n  - 'Bar chart: embedding delta (pp) at each data size. Shows delta growing from 0.3\n    to 1.0 as data increases, suggesting mining benefit requires sufficient data diversity.'\n  analysis: 'Data scaling 是 positive signal：说明 embedding mining 的 benefit 不是 overfitting\n    artifact（否则小数据时 delta 应更大）。但 sub-linear scaling 和 5K 时仍只有 +1.0pp 的 delta 说明 pretrained\n    representation quality 是 bottleneck，更多 data 不会 dramatically 改变 strategy ranking。适合放入\n    appendix，支撑 \"mining benefit is real but modest\" 的 narrative。\n\n    '\n- name: Fusion Head Ablation\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: Embedding-only vs structural-features-only vs combined scoring head\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_embedding_only_R1: 0.539\n    qwen_structural_only_R1: 0.412\n    qwen_combined_R1: 0.541\n    starcoder_embedding_only_R1: 0.449\n    starcoder_structural_only_R1: 0.378\n    starcoder_combined_R1: 0.451\n    combined_minus_embedding_only_pp: 0.2\n  result_rationale: 'Structural-features-only（仅用 dataflow connectivity、call-graph\n    distance 等 discrete features）大幅落后，因为 binary/categorical structural features 的\n    信息量远不及 dense embedding。Combined head 相比 embedding-only 仅 +0.2pp， 因为在 median 档下\n    structural signal 本身就弱（plan_005 已示），fusion 无法 从弱 signal 中 extract 出更多 information。这说明\n    structural information 的 value 主要体现在 negative selection（training time）而非 scoring（inference\n    time）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Fusion Head Ablation R@1'\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - Emb-only\n    - Struct-only\n    - Combined\n    - Combined−Emb (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - 0.539\n      - 0.412\n      - 0.541\n      - '+0.2'\n    - - StarCoder\n      - 0.449\n      - 0.378\n      - 0.451\n      - '+0.2'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: R@1 by head type × encoder. Structural-only bar dramatically lower,\n    combined and embedding-only nearly identical.'\n  analysis: '确认 StructFuse 的 value 在 training-time negative selection 而非 inference-time\n    feature fusion。Combined head 的 marginal gain 可能不值得 inference-time 的 CodeQL dependency。论文中作为\n    appendix ablation，支撑 \"negative selection is the key mechanism\" 的 argument。\n\n    '\n- name: Dataflow-Distance Weighted vs Binary Negatives\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: Weighted sampling by dataflow distance vs binary connected/disconnected\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_binary_df_R1: 0.532\n    qwen_weighted_df_R1: 0.535\n    starcoder_binary_df_R1: 0.437\n    starcoder_weighted_df_R1: 0.439\n    weighted_minus_binary_pp: 0.3\n    weighted_minus_binary_CI:\n    - -0.8\n    - 1.4\n  result_rationale: 'Distance-weighted sampling 理论上应该更好：给距离更远（更 disconnected）的 negatives\n    更高采样概率，提供更 clean 的 structural signal。但在 median 档下 dataflow strategy 本身 effect\n    size 就小，在此基础上的 second-order refinement 自然更小（+0.3pp），CI 宽且包含 0。实际上 binary 和 weighted\n    的差异主要来自 少数 outlier queries（dataflow distance 分布高度 skewed），大多数 queries 的 negatives\n    在两种 scheme 下 overlap 很大。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Binary vs Weighted Dataflow Negatives'\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - Binary DF R@1\n    - Weighted DF R@1\n    - Δ (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - 0.532\n      - 0.535\n      - '+0.3'\n    - - StarCoder\n      - 0.437\n      - 0.439\n      - '+0.2'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired scatter: per-query R@1 difference (weighted − binary) vs dataflow distance\n    range. Most queries cluster near 0 difference; outliers with high distance range\n    show positive delta.'\n  analysis: 'Effect 太小，不值得增加 pipeline complexity。Binary 作为默认 simple choice 是合理的。 放入\n    appendix 一句话即可。\n\n    '\n- name: SWE-bench Failure Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 50 SweRank/BM25 failures, categorize by whether dataflow helps\n  expected_results:\n    total_failures_analyzed: 50\n    category_structural_gap: 14\n    category_lexical_gap: 18\n    category_multi_file_dependency: 8\n    category_other: 10\n    df_helps_in_structural_gap_pct: 57\n    df_helps_overall_pct: 28\n    emb_helps_overall_pct: 36\n  result_rationale: '50 个 failure cases 中，仅 14 个（28%）属于 structural gap（即 gold file\n    与 query 有 dataflow 关系但无 lexical similarity）。在这 14 个中，dataflow strategy 成功 retrieve\n    了 8 个（57%），但剩余 6 个仍然 fail 因为 structural data 不覆盖（34% coverage limitation）。最大的\n    failure category 是 lexical gap（36%，query 描述 与 target file 用语完全不同），这两种 strategy\n    都无法解决。这解释了为什么 overall effect size 小：真正 benefit from structural signal 的 cases\n    只占 ~28%，且其中 仍有近半 coverage 不足。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Failure Category Distribution'\n    columns:\n    - Category\n    - Count\n    - '%'\n    - DF helps\n    - Emb helps\n    rows:\n    - - Structural gap\n      - 14\n      - 28%\n      - 8 (57%)\n      - 5 (36%)\n    - - Lexical gap\n      - 18\n      - 36%\n      - 3 (17%)\n      - 6 (33%)\n    - - Multi-file dependency\n      - 8\n      - 16%\n      - 4 (50%)\n      - 5 (63%)\n    - - Other\n      - 10\n      - 20%\n      - 1 (10%)\n      - 2 (20%)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Stacked horizontal bar: failure categories with sub-bars showing DF-helps vs\n    DF-not-helps. Structural gap bar has the highest DF-helps proportion but is a\n    minority category.'\n  analysis: 'Failure analysis 提供了 qualitative evidence 支撑 \"structural signal helps\n    in specific conditions\" 的 narrative，但也暴露了 ceiling：真正 structural gap 的 cases 只占\n    28%，coverage 限制了其中一半。适合放入 Section 5 的 analysis 段落， 不足以 support independent claim。\n\n    '\n- name: Qualitative Case Studies\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: 5-10 cases where structural negatives changed retrieval outcome\n  expected_results:\n    total_cases_selected: 7\n    cases_df_uniquely_helps: 3\n    cases_emb_uniquely_helps: 2\n    cases_both_help: 2\n    avg_gold_rank_improvement_df: 4.2\n    avg_gold_rank_improvement_emb: 2.8\n  result_rationale: 'Cherry-picking 7 个 illustrative cases。3 个 cases 中 dataflow strategy\n    将 gold file 从 rank 8-15 提升到 rank 1-3（大幅改善），这些 cases 的共同特征是 gold file 与 query 有\n    call-chain dependency 但无 keyword overlap。2 个 cases 中 embedding strategy 独特帮助（gold\n    file 与 query 有 similar variable naming 但 random negatives 中缺少 near-miss distractors）。但\n    cherry-picked cases 不代表 overall distribution（见 plan_011 的 28% structural gap rate）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Selected Qualitative Cases'\n    columns:\n    - Case\n    - Repo\n    - Issue type\n    - Random rank\n    - Emb rank\n    - DF rank\n    - Key observation\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - repo_A\n      - missing import\n      - 12\n      - 8\n      - 2\n      - DF finds cross-module callee\n    - - 2\n      - repo_B\n      - API mismatch\n      - 9\n      - 3\n      - 4\n      - Emb finds similar naming\n    - - 3\n      - repo_C\n      - config propagation\n      - 15\n      - 11\n      - 1\n      - DF traces config flow\n    - - 4\n      - repo_D\n      - type error\n      - 6\n      - 2\n      - 3\n      - Both find related types\n    - - 5\n      - repo_E\n      - null pointer\n      - 11\n      - 7\n      - 3\n      - DF finds data source\n    - - 6\n      - repo_F\n      - method override\n      - 4\n      - 1\n      - 5\n      - Emb captures signature sim\n    - - 7\n      - repo_G\n      - circular dep\n      - 14\n      - 10\n      - 2\n      - DF traces dependency cycle\n  figures_description:\n  - Side-by-side code snippets for top 3 DF-helps cases, showing query → gold file\n    with dataflow path highlighted. Annotated with rank under each strategy.\n  analysis: 'Qualitative examples 是论文的 illustration 而非 evidence。选择具有 pedagogical value\n    的 cases 来解释 mechanism。在 median 档下，需要 caveat \"these are selected to illustrate\n    the mechanism; overall effect size is modest (Table X)\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Temperature Ablation\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: τ ∈ {0.05, 0.1, 0.2} × 3 strategies × 2 encoders\n  expected_results:\n    qwen:\n      tau_005:\n        random_R1: 0.53\n        embedding_R1: 0.54\n        dataflow_R1: 0.532\n        emb_delta_pp: 1.0\n      tau_010:\n        random_R1: 0.537\n        embedding_R1: 0.545\n        dataflow_R1: 0.537\n        emb_delta_pp: 0.8\n      tau_020:\n        random_R1: 0.521\n        embedding_R1: 0.526\n        dataflow_R1: 0.52\n        emb_delta_pp: 0.5\n    starcoder:\n      tau_005:\n        random_R1: 0.443\n        embedding_R1: 0.45\n        dataflow_R1: 0.437\n        emb_delta_pp: 0.7\n      tau_010:\n        random_R1: 0.451\n        embedding_R1: 0.457\n        dataflow_R1: 0.446\n        emb_delta_pp: 0.6\n      tau_020:\n        random_R1: 0.435\n        embedding_R1: 0.438\n        dataflow_R1: 0.43\n        emb_delta_pp: 0.3\n    optimal_tau: 0.1\n    strategy_ranking_preserved_across_tau: true\n    delta_shrinks_at_high_tau: true\n  result_rationale: 'τ=0.05（当前默认）可能过低：contrastive loss 的 gradient 过于 sharp，模型对 hard\n    negatives 过度 sensitive，导致 overfitting（plan_002 中 step 500 后即 overfit）。 τ=0.1 在\n    median 档下反而略好：gradient 更 smooth，模型更 robust，absolute R@1 比 τ=0.05 高 ~0.7pp（Qwen）和\n    ~0.8pp（StarCoder）。但 strategy delta 在 τ=0.1 时略小（0.8pp vs 1.0pp Qwen），因为 smoother\n    gradient 也 smooth 掉了 hard negative 的 extra signal。τ=0.2 过高：loss landscape 太 flat，training\n    signal 不足， all strategies 退化。关键发现：strategy ranking（embedding > random ≥ dataflow）\n    在所有 τ 下保持一致，说明 finding 不是 regime-specific。但 delta 随 τ 增大而 缩小，表明在 optimal τ 下 effect\n    size 可能更小。这是 median 档的典型 pattern： finding 方向 robust 但 magnitude 依赖 hyperparameter。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: R@1 by Temperature × Strategy (Qwen)'\n    columns:\n    - τ\n    - Random\n    - Embedding\n    - Dataflow\n    - Emb Δ (pp)\n    - Best strat\n    rows:\n    - - 0.05\n      - 0.53\n      - 0.54\n      - 0.532\n      - '+1.0'\n      - embedding\n    - - 0.1\n      - 0.537\n      - 0.545\n      - 0.537\n      - '+0.8'\n      - embedding\n    - - 0.2\n      - 0.521\n      - 0.526\n      - 0.52\n      - '+0.5'\n      - embedding\n  - name: 'Table: R@1 by Temperature × Strategy (StarCoder)'\n    columns:\n    - τ\n    - Random\n    - Embedding\n    - Dataflow\n    - Emb Δ (pp)\n    - Best strat\n    rows:\n    - - 0.05\n      - 0.443\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.437\n      - '+0.7'\n      - embedding\n    - - 0.1\n      - 0.451\n      - 0.457\n      - 0.446\n      - '+0.6'\n      - embedding\n    - - 0.2\n      - 0.435\n      - 0.438\n      - 0.43\n      - '+0.3'\n      - embedding\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: R@1 vs τ for each strategy, dual-panel (Qwen | StarCoder). All strategies\n    show inverted-U with peak at τ=0.1. Embedding line consistently above random.'\n  - 'Bar chart: embedding delta (pp) vs τ. Monotonically decreasing from τ=0.05 to\n    τ=0.2, showing that harder temperature amplifies strategy differences.'\n  analysis: 'Temperature ablation 提供两个 key findings：(1) strategy ranking 在 τ 范围内 preserved（robustness\n    check passed），(2) optimal τ 可能是 0.1 而非 0.05，但在 optimal τ 下 embedding delta 只有\n    0.6-0.8pp。这要求论文报告 best-τ 结果时 acknowledge effect size 进一步缩小。建议报告 τ=0.05 作为 primary（与\n    prior work 对齐）加 τ sensitivity 在 appendix。如果 reviewer 质疑 regime-specificity， 可以\n    argue ranking preserved 但 concede magnitude is τ-dependent。\n\n    '\n- name: Dynamic vs Static Embedding Mining\n  plan_id: plan_015\n  description: Dynamic re-mine embedding negatives per epoch vs static (mine once\n    from pretrained), Qwen encoder\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_static_emb_R1: 0.54\n    qwen_dynamic_emb_R1: 0.544\n    dynamic_minus_static_pp: 0.4\n    dynamic_minus_static_CI:\n    - -0.8\n    - 1.6\n    training_time_ratio_dynamic_vs_static: 2.3\n  result_rationale: 'Dynamic mining 每个 epoch 用 current encoder 重新计算 embeddings 并 re-mine\n    negatives，理论上 negatives 始终 adaptive to current model state。但在 median 档下 static\n    mining 本身 effect size 就小（+1.0pp），dynamic 的 incremental gain 仅 +0.4pp，因为 (1) training\n    只跑 2-3 epochs，encoder 变化不大，re-mining 的 negatives 与 static 的 overlap 很大（estimated\n    > 80% overlap），(2) dynamic mining 需要 per-epoch full-corpus encoding，training time\n    翻 2.3x，cost-benefit 不划算。CI 包含 0，说明 gain 不 significant。这个结果也部分缓解了 \"static mining\n    confound\" 的 reviewer concern：dynamic 没有 dramatically 改变 picture。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Static vs Dynamic Embedding Mining (Qwen)'\n    columns:\n    - Mining\n    - R@1\n    - Δ vs static (pp)\n    - Train time (h)\n    - CI\n    rows:\n    - - static\n      - 0.54\n      - —\n      - 7.5\n      - —\n    - - dynamic\n      - 0.544\n      - '+0.4'\n      - 17.3\n      - '[-0.8, 1.6]'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: R@1 for static vs dynamic with CI error bars. Bars nearly equal height\n    with overlapping CIs.'\n  - 'Venn diagram or overlap histogram: negative set overlap between static and dynamic\n    at epoch 1, 2, 3. Shows > 80% overlap at all epochs.'\n  analysis: 'Dynamic mining 是 expensive 的 marginal improvement。论文中一句话 dismiss this\n    confound：\"We additionally tested dynamic re-mining (per-epoch) and found no significant\n    improvement over static mining (Δ=+0.4pp, p=0.38), likely because the encoder\n    changes minimally over 2-3 epochs.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Bootstrap CI for SWE-bench Resolve Rate\n  plan_id: plan_016\n  description: 95% bootstrap confidence intervals for all strategy comparisons on\n    SWE-bench Lite\n  expected_results:\n    n_bootstrap_samples: 10000\n    random_resolve_rate_pct: 23.0\n    random_CI:\n    - 18.3\n    - 27.7\n    embedding_resolve_rate_pct: 23.7\n    embedding_CI:\n    - 18.7\n    - 28.3\n    dataflow_resolve_rate_pct: 23.3\n    dataflow_CI:\n    - 18.3\n    - 28.0\n    emb_minus_random_delta_pp: 0.7\n    emb_minus_random_CI:\n    - -3.2\n    - 4.5\n    emb_minus_random_p_value: 0.62\n    df_minus_random_delta_pp: 0.3\n    df_minus_random_CI:\n    - -3.8\n    - 4.4\n    df_minus_random_p_value: 0.78\n    any_comparison_significant: false\n  result_rationale: 'N=300 binary outcomes（resolve/not-resolve）的 bootstrap CI 很宽：individual\n    strategy 的 CI width ~9.5pp，paired delta 的 CI width ~7.7pp。这是因为 binary outcome\n    的 variance 最大（Bernoulli variance = p(1-p) ≈ 0.18），300 instances 给出的 standard error\n    ≈ sqrt(0.18/300) ≈ 0.024 = 2.4pp，95% CI ≈ ±4.7pp。 在 delta < 1pp 的情况下，不可能 achieve\n    significance。这是 fundamental power limitation，不是方法问题。Even with 3000 instances (full\n    SWE-bench)，delta 0.7pp 仍需要 N > 15000 才能 detect with 80% power。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: SWE-bench Bootstrap CIs'\n    columns:\n    - Comparison\n    - Δ (pp)\n    - 95% CI\n    - p-value\n    - Significant?\n    rows:\n    - - emb − random\n      - '+0.7'\n      - '[-3.2, 4.5]'\n      - 0.62\n      - 'No'\n    - - df − random\n      - '+0.3'\n      - '[-3.8, 4.4]'\n      - 0.78\n      - 'No'\n    - - emb − df\n      - '+0.3'\n      - '[-3.5, 4.2]'\n      - 0.73\n      - 'No'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Forest plot: paired delta with 95% CI for each comparison. All CIs cross zero,\n    none close to significance.'\n  - 'Power analysis curve: required N to detect Δ=0.7pp at 80% power. Shows N > 15000,\n    far beyond SWE-bench Lite''s 300.'\n  analysis: 'SWE-bench CIs 确认 end-to-end evaluation 对 retrieval strategy 的 sensitivity\n    不足。这不是 negative result 而是 power limitation。论文中必须 transparently 报告 \"SWE-bench evaluation\n    confirms no strategy harms downstream performance, but the benchmark is underpowered\n    to detect the retrieval-stage deltas we observe (< 1pp)\"。Power analysis figure\n    可放入 appendix 支撑此 argument。\n\n    '\n- name: Inference-Time Graph Method Literature Comparison\n  plan_id: plan_017\n  description: Analysis-only comparison with CodexGraph, LocAgent, RANGER etc. (no\n    experiment)\n  expected_results:\n    papers_compared: 8\n    key_distinction: training-time mining vs inference-time navigation\n    complementary_not_competing: true\n    overlap_with_our_approach: minimal — they inject structure at inference, we use\n      structure for training data curation\n  result_rationale: '8 篇 inference-time graph 方法（CodexGraph, LocAgent, RANGER, GraphCoder,\n    ARISE, RepoGraph, CodeGRAG, CodeRAG）都在 inference 时构建或查询 code graph。与 StructFuse\n    的区别是 fundamental：我们在 training time 用 graph 选 negatives，他们在 inference time 用 graph\n    navigate。二者理论上 complementary（可以用 StructFuse 训练的 retriever 作为这些 inference-time\n    methods 的 backbone）。但 median 档下我们 没有实验验证 complementarity，只能 argue in principle。这个\n    literature gap 在 前几轮 review 中被 flagged（best-R2-W5），written comparison 应该足够 address。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Comparison with Inference-Time Graph Methods'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Graph type\n    - When used\n    - Scope\n    - Complementary?\n    rows:\n    - - CodexGraph\n      - Repository graph\n      - Inference\n      - Navigation\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - LocAgent\n      - Code structure\n      - Inference\n      - Localization\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - RANGER\n      - AST + deps\n      - Inference\n      - Ranking\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - StructFuse (ours)\n      - Dataflow\n      - Training\n      - Neg mining\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Taxonomy diagram: 2×2 matrix of (training/inference) × (text-only/structure-enhanced)\n    methods, positioning StructFuse in the training+structure quadrant alongside ANCE/curriculum\n    mining in training+text.'\n  analysis: 'Discussion section 需要明确 position StructFuse 为 complementary approach，not\n    competing with inference-time methods。这也为 future work 提供了 natural extension： combine\n    StructFuse-trained retriever with inference-time graph navigation。 Median 档下这是\n    speculative future work 而非 verified claim。\n\n    '\n- name: BM25 Hard Negative Baseline\n  plan_id: plan_018\n  description: BM25-based hard negatives as 4th strategy, 1 seed × 2 encoders, compare\n    with random/embedding/dataflow\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_bm25_R1: 0.521\n    qwen_random_R1: 0.53\n    qwen_embedding_R1: 0.54\n    qwen_bm25_minus_random_pp: -0.9\n    qwen_bm25_minus_random_CI:\n    - -2.8\n    - 1.0\n    qwen_bm25_minus_random_p_value: 0.12\n    starcoder_bm25_R1: 0.436\n    starcoder_random_R1: 0.443\n    starcoder_embedding_R1: 0.45\n    starcoder_bm25_minus_random_pp: -0.7\n    starcoder_bm25_minus_random_CI:\n    - -2.5\n    - 1.1\n    starcoder_bm25_minus_random_p_value: 0.18\n    bm25_rank: worst among 4 strategies\n    bm25_vs_embedding_delta_pp_qwen: -1.9\n    bm25_vs_embedding_delta_pp_starcoder: -1.4\n  result_rationale: 'BM25 negatives 是 lexical-similarity top-k，与 true embedding distance\n    negatives 的 selection 方式 fundamentally 不同。BM25 top-k 主要 capture keyword overlap\n    （function names, import statements），这些 \"negatives\" 中很多实际上是 semantically related（可能包含\n    false negatives / actual positives mislabeled as negatives）， 导致 noisy training\n    signal。在 median 档下，BM25 harm 方向正确（-0.9pp Qwen, -0.7pp StarCoder），但 delta 小于 CoCoHaNeRe\n    报告的 -27pp。原因：(1) 我们的 training pipeline 更 robust（proper temperature, early stopping），(2)\n    pool=50 限制了 BM25 negatives 的 \"hardness\"（不像 CoCoHaNeRe 的 full-corpus mining）。 p\n    > 0.05 说明 harm 不 significant，but direction is consistent。这 partially closes the\n    correction argument：可以 say \"BM25-proxy negatives harm in the direction CoCoHaNeRe\n    reports, but the magnitude in our controlled setup is much smaller, suggesting\n    their -27pp included other confounds beyond negative source\"。 不能 fully close（p\n    > 0.05），只能 partially support。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 4-Strategy Comparison R@1'\n    columns:\n    - Strategy\n    - Qwen R@1\n    - StarCoder R@1\n    - Qwen Δ vs Random\n    - StarCoder Δ vs Random\n    rows:\n    - - random\n      - 0.53\n      - 0.443\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - embedding\n      - 0.54\n      - 0.45\n      - '+1.0'\n      - '+0.7'\n    - - dataflow\n      - 0.532\n      - 0.437\n      - '+0.2'\n      - −0.6\n    - - BM25\n      - 0.521\n      - 0.436\n      - −0.9\n      - −0.7\n  - name: 'Table: BM25 vs Embedding Delta (the CoCoHaNeRe gap)'\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - BM25 R@1\n    - Emb R@1\n    - Δ (pp)\n    - CoCoHaNeRe reported\n    - Our explanation\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - 0.521\n      - 0.54\n      - −1.9\n      - −27\n      - Different mining protocol, pool size, pipeline robustness\n    - - StarCoder\n      - 0.436\n      - 0.45\n      - −1.4\n      - n/a\n      - Consistent direction, smaller magnitude\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: R@1 for 4 strategies × 2 encoders. BM25 bar clearly lowest, embedding\n    highest. Error bars (1-seed, bootstrap over eval set) show BM25 CI overlapping\n    random.'\n  - 'Scatter plot: per-query BM25-negative similarity vs embedding-negative similarity,\n    colored by whether query was correctly retrieved. Shows that BM25 negatives cluster\n    in a different similarity region (high lexical, medium semantic) than embedding\n    negatives (high semantic).'\n  - 'Venn diagram: overlap between BM25 top-5 negatives and embedding top-5 negatives.\n    Shows ~30% overlap, confirming they are selecting different negative populations.'\n  analysis: 'BM25 baseline 是 median 档下最重要的新增实验。它 partially 但不 fully closes the CoCoHaNeRe\n    correction argument。方向一致（BM25 harm, embedding help）支撑了 \"proxy conflation\" 的 narrative，但\n    delta 太小（-0.9pp vs -27pp）且 p > 0.05 意味着 argument 需要 soften。论文叙事从 \"we prove CoCoHaNeRe\n    was wrong\" 调整为 \"we observe that BM25-proxy negatives trend toward harm while true\n    embedding negatives trend toward benefit, consistent with the hypothesis that\n    CoCoHaNeRe''s reported -27pp harm was amplified by proxy conflation and other\n    uncontrolled factors\"。这是 median 档 framing 的核心转变。Need related work 深度对比 （ANCE,\n    curriculum mining, DPR hard negatives）来 contextualize 为什么 effect size 在 code domain\n    普遍 modest。\n\n    '\n- name: Pool Size Sensitivity Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_019\n  description: Strategy ranking stability at pool={50, 100, 200, 500} on SWE-smith\n    validation\n  expected_results:\n    qwen:\n      pool_50:\n        random_R1: 0.53\n        embedding_R1: 0.54\n        dataflow_R1: 0.532\n        ranking: emb > df > rand\n      pool_100:\n        random_R1: 0.412\n        embedding_R1: 0.421\n        dataflow_R1: 0.413\n        ranking: emb > df ≈ rand\n      pool_200:\n        random_R1: 0.328\n        embedding_R1: 0.335\n        dataflow_R1: 0.33\n        ranking: emb > df ≈ rand\n      pool_500:\n        random_R1: 0.241\n        embedding_R1: 0.246\n        dataflow_R1: 0.244\n        ranking: emb ≈ df ≈ rand\n    starcoder:\n      pool_50:\n        random_R1: 0.443\n        embedding_R1: 0.45\n        dataflow_R1: 0.437\n        ranking: emb > rand > df\n      pool_100:\n        random_R1: 0.339\n        embedding_R1: 0.345\n        dataflow_R1: 0.334\n        ranking: emb > rand > df\n      pool_200:\n        random_R1: 0.268\n        embedding_R1: 0.272\n        dataflow_R1: 0.271\n        ranking: emb ≈ df ≈ rand\n      pool_500:\n        random_R1: 0.194\n        embedding_R1: 0.196\n        dataflow_R1: 0.197\n        ranking: df ≈ emb ≈ rand\n    pool_ranking_stable_pct: 62.5\n    ranking_crossover_threshold: pool ≥ 200\n    absolute_R1_decline_per_10x_pool: 0.18\n  result_rationale: 'Pool size 增大时所有 strategies 的 absolute R@1 大幅下降（从 pool=50 的 ~53%\n    到 pool=500 的 ~24%），因为 retrieval 的 baseline difficulty 增加。Strategy delta 也随 pool\n    增大而压缩：pool=50 时 embedding delta=+1.0pp，pool=500 时仅 +0.5pp。 原因是大 pool 中 distractors\n    更 diverse，training-time 的 hard negative strategy 只 prepare 了模型应对特定 difficulty\n    分布，但 pool=500 时 test-time 的 difficulty distribution 超出了 training-time 的 coverage。在\n    pool ≥ 200 时偶有 ranking 交叉（StarCoder pool=500 时 dataflow 反超 embedding by 0.1pp），但差异在\n    noise range 内。Overall ranking stability 62.5%（8 个 encoder×pool 组合中 5 个保持 embedding\n    > rest），低于 best 档的 >80% 但高于 worst 档的 <50%。这说明 finding \"directionally holds but\n    weakens\" at larger pools，需在论文中 caveat。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: R@1 by Pool Size × Strategy (Qwen)'\n    columns:\n    - Pool\n    - Random\n    - Embedding\n    - Dataflow\n    - Emb Δ (pp)\n    - Ranking stable?\n    rows:\n    - - 50\n      - 0.53\n      - 0.54\n      - 0.532\n      - '+1.0'\n      - ✓\n    - - 100\n      - 0.412\n      - 0.421\n      - 0.413\n      - '+0.9'\n      - ✓\n    - - 200\n      - 0.328\n      - 0.335\n      - 0.33\n      - '+0.7'\n      - ✓\n    - - 500\n      - 0.241\n      - 0.246\n      - 0.244\n      - '+0.5'\n      - ✓\n  - name: 'Table: R@1 by Pool Size × Strategy (StarCoder)'\n    columns:\n    - Pool\n    - Random\n    - Embedding\n    - Dataflow\n    - Emb Δ (pp)\n    - Ranking stable?\n    rows:\n    - - 50\n      - 0.443\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.437\n      - '+0.7'\n      - ✓\n    - - 100\n      - 0.339\n      - 0.345\n      - 0.334\n      - '+0.6'\n      - ✓\n    - - 200\n      - 0.268\n      - 0.272\n      - 0.271\n      - '+0.4'\n      - '~'\n    - - 500\n      - 0.194\n      - 0.196\n      - 0.197\n      - '+0.2'\n      - ✗\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: R@1 vs pool size (log scale) for each strategy, dual-panel (Qwen |\n    StarCoder). All lines decline; strategy gap narrows visibly at pool ≥ 200.'\n  - 'Delta plot: embedding−random delta (pp) vs pool size. Monotonically declining\n    curve, approaching zero at pool = 500.'\n  - 'Heatmap: strategy ranking (1st/2nd/3rd) at each pool size × encoder. Transition\n    from stable ranking at pool ≤ 100 to unstable at pool ≥ 200.'\n  analysis: Pool size sensitivity 是 median 档下最重要的 external validity check。结果显示 embedding\n    mining 优势 real 但 diminishing with pool size。论文需要 honestly discuss：(1) pool=50\n    是 validation setup，real-world repo pool 通常 200-1000+， (2) at realistic pool sizes\n    the advantage shrinks to ~0.5pp。这强化了 \"systematic study\" 而非 \"strong method contribution\"\n    的 positioning。建议在 main paper 中报告 pool=50 和 pool=200 的双 benchmark，并在 limitation\n    中讨论 pool=500 的 convergence。\n","numLines":1261,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1261}}}
